  <para style="h">Marukwus</para>
  <para style="toc1">Marukwus</para>
  <para style="toc2">Marukwus</para>
  <para style="toc3">Mar</para>
  <para style="mt1">Marukwus</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="MRK 1" />
  <para style="s1">Yohana batizimazhniyi zhni zokwo aba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 1:1" />Yeisu Kirisiti, Shekwoyi Nugwnu anabagyi manai ayayaba, <verse eid="MRK 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 1:2" />ngye shi kwo kafyilo dna n sheɓəgwognayi Ishaya:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 1:2">“Mi ɓə tnú n əmi tnutnudayii woi la gyilo ń əho abye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 1:2">əwo nu ɓə zhni əho zokwo aba.”<verse eid="MRK 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 1:3" />“Əza bəgye dnawyi lo dna ń zhabwikawu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 1:3">‘Zhni zokwo ga Dagayi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 1:3">la awogye tacé ceewo ntu n əwo ɓo.’ ”<verse eid="MRK 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 1:4" />Ntulonu Yohana Batizimazhniyi wa kpeyaɓe dna n zhabwikawu, woi zhni waazi batizima abwuye nya ntu n aleifyi zo ɓo. <verse eid="MRK 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 1:5" />Azhigba vnyanya ń Yahudiya ɓədo n azai vnyanya fyi ń Urishelima ɓa kwnuya lo da wo. Ɓai da əɓa aleifyi, wa zhni ɓa batizima dna n Urudu əlà. <verse eid="MRK 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 1:6" />Aje n Yohana ɓə ncei kpe nyi, a ɓə zhni ɓa n lakwnumi əyii nu, wo ɓə n gigyii znu ń əwo əshni n əshnipa nyai nu, jesnu àɓo nu ɓə zhni əwo nyagyi n əsugbmài. <verse eid="MRK 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 1:7" />Əwo waazi nu ɓə nyi: “N əmi avnu əzado ɓe lo n wo du mi lo n kalá, mi to kwnuce lo ma ceakwokwo shi ma lo əwo abwada abma ya m. <verse eid="MRK 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 1:8" />Mi zhni fye batizima n nuwnai nu, ama wo ɓə zhni fye batizima n Zafnu Gyigyiyii.”<verse eid="MRK 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeisu batizimazhni n əwo mwumwui</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 1:9" />Dna n əsa yi, Yeisu wa gbmiɓe n Nazereti, dna n Gəlili əknyi, jesnu Yohana wa zhni wo batizima dna n Urudu əlà. <verse eid="MRK 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 1:10" />Əsa n Yeisu ɓə gbmiɓe n nuwna, wa gye əshemi n gwuya gnyi, jesnu Zafnui shnizhi tu n wo ngye lukpe. <verse eid="MRK 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 1:11" />Wa wo bəgye kwoi gbmiɓe n əshemi kwoi gna, “Əho nu zhni əmi Nugwnu n mi ye nyi; agbmada mi n hoi n mwa.”<verse eid="MRK 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 1:12" />N əsagbmanyii Zafnu wa gbmi wo ya dnalo ncei n zhabwikawu. <verse eid="MRK 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 1:13" />Wo ɓə la dna n zhabwikawu anyipyei shiinyi, Shetam woi mwu wo. Wo ɓə dna n kwnusnu n anyafwanyai nu jesnu amaləka ɓa bma wo zhni.<verse eid="MRK 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeisu dna anabagyi manai əwyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 1:14" />Shi a ɓə la Yohana gwudna n zhalu, Yeisu wa lodna n Gəlili, woi dna Shekwoyi nabagyi manai əwyi. <verse eid="MRK 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 1:15" />Wa gna, “Əsa kwo la si, Shekwoyi əbemi kwo la ɓe vyivyiwyi. Fye yeabwi jesnu fya ga nabagyi manai gaiciya!”<verse eid="MRK 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeisu yi amwutuyi kpmisnuyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 1:16" />Shi Yeisu ɓə lo woi znazna ma lo n Gəlili əlàgbe, wa gye Sima n əwodoi Anduru ɓai she əsa fyi n nuwna-znudna, ntuge ɓa ɓə zhni abmyawnayi nu. <verse eid="MRK 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 1:17" />Yeisu wa gna, “Fye ɓe, fya vyi mi, jesnu mi ɓə tnu n fyei, fya wna aza ngye abmya.” <verse eid="MRK 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 1:18" />N əsagbmanyii, ɓa ya əɓa asa zhi, jesnu ɓa vyi wo.<verse eid="MRK 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 1:19" />Shi wo ɓə ceta lo n abyei fyewyi, wa gye Jemyis Zebədi nugwnu n kwnusnu n əwodoi Yohana, n fyi n əya nuwnanya ɓai zhni əɓa asa aba. <verse eid="MRK 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 1:20" />Ntna əsa wnuyai, wa yì ɓa, jesnu ɓa fa əɓa dada Zebədi dna n əya nuwnanya n kwnusnu n agwodogwo zhniyii, ɓa vyi wo.<verse eid="MRK 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeisu gbmi zafnu ajegbmiyi ya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 1:21" />Ɓa lo Kapanam, she Sibyiwyi ɓə si, Yeisu wa lodna n Ayahudiyibwokwnu wa ya nyawu. <verse eid="MRK 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 1:22" />Əwo nyawu kwaa wo aza, ntuge wo ɓə wunya ngye əza nu n wo n ikwoi, toge ngye owa anyawuyi m. <verse eid="MRK 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 1:23" />Nsayii, əzaho ɓə dna n Ayahudiyibwokwnu ń wo ɓə n zafnu ajegbmiyi, wa sáwyi, <verse eid="MRK 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 1:24" />“Ho ye knyiyi nu n əyi a, Yeisu Nazeretiyii? Ha ɓe ha zhni yi agbma nu? Mi kpe əza əye lo n wo gnyi n hoi; Gyigyiyida, Shekwoyi nya!”<verse eid="MRK 1:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 1:25" />Yeisu wa gnaknyi zafnu n əwyei bmyibmyiyi ge, “La cepyi! Gbmiya ɓe n wo!” <verse eid="MRK 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 1:26" />Zafnu ajegbmiyi kwa je wo ashna n kalái, jesnu kwa gbmiya n wo kwoi fyiakwu.<verse eid="MRK 1:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 1:27" />Ca wo aza vnyanya n mwa, kwa zhni ɓa ɓà nya aje əɓo, “Knyiɓei nu nyi a? Nyawu woiwoyi ń ikwoi ɓədo! Kwo azafnu ajegbmiyi, wo ga ɓa ɓəgbe jesnu ɓai vyi wo ɓəgbetu.” <verse eid="MRK 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 1:28" />Əwo anabagyi kwa gnamyi fyi n Gəlili əknyi vnyanya n pyeepyé.<verse eid="MRK 1:28" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeisu ga aza bəgyé kágna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 1:29" />She ɓa ɓə ze n kwnukwnui ń Ayahudiyibwokwnu, ɓa lo Sima n Andurui pwuwa, n kwnusnu n Jemyis n Yohanai. <verse eid="MRK 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 1:30" />Sima yezhi nyikwozada ɓə tu ń gədo n nayi-nagwnu yi, nsayisayii, ɓa gna Yeisu əwo əɓo. <verse eid="MRK 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 1:31" />Ntulonu wa lo wo aba, wa shi wo n əɓwa, wa laka tu ń ase. Nayi-nagwnu kwa fa wo, wa laka gnyi wa ya ɓa ɓəvyi.<verse eid="MRK 1:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 1:32" />N wyeshe yii, she nyipyei ɓəə la shni, aza ɓa ɓe Yeisu n anyasnayii ɓədo ń ase-anyasnayii vnyanya. <verse eid="MRK 1:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 1:33" />Əzhi vnyanya kwaa yezhi n abwokwnumigbe, <verse eid="MRK 1:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 1:34" />jesnu Yeisu ɓə la aza bəgyé kágna n ɓa ɓə n anyasnai gbowogbowo. Waa ase bəgyé kwnuya, to wa ye ase nge ɓa daɓo m, ntuge ɓa ɓə kpé əza pya ye n wo ɓə zhni.<verse eid="MRK 1:34" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeisu aduwazhni gnyi n aba pyipyipyii.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 1:35" />N labmilabmii, to ənyai zo knaya m, Yeisu wa laka, wa gbmiya n apyi wa lo aba pyipyipyii, aba n wo ɓə zhniaduwa. <verse eid="MRK 1:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 1:36" />Sima n əwo azajei ɓa lo əwo znashni. <verse eid="MRK 1:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 1:37" />Əsa n ɓa ɓə gye wo əwye, ɓa gna: “Zahozahoyi zna ho shni lo!”<verse eid="MRK 1:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 1:38" />Yeisu wa dnaɓəgbe, “Fye ɓe ya lo ɓwado n kasnu, nabai n mi ɓəə zhni waazi ce n abaayi. Cenu ɓə zhni mà ɓe.” <verse eid="MRK 1:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 1:39" />Ntulonu wa zna laɓa n Gəlili əknyi vnyanya woi zhni waazi n əɓa Ayahudiyibwokwnu woi kwnu ɓa ase ya.<verse eid="MRK 1:39" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeisu ká nayiwnuyi gna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 1:40" />Əzaho n nayiwnu nyasnai wa ɓe da wo wa ceakwokwo shi, wa ɓa wo, “Ngye əho əɓəye nu, ho ɓa myi ha ka mi gna.”<verse eid="MRK 1:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 1:41" />Yeisu ń nunui gnyi n snusnugyei, wa ta əwo əɓwa ya wa to wo əɓwa wa gna, “Əmi ɓəye nu, gwo kágna.” <verse eid="MRK 1:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 1:42" />Nsayisayii nayiwnu nyasna kwa fa wo jesnu wa ɓwa kágna.<verse eid="MRK 1:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 1:43" />Yeisu wa gna wo ami, wa kwnù wo n əwyei bmyibmyii: <verse eid="MRK 1:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 1:44" />“To gna zahozahoyi ɓəye m. Ama lo, ho wu əhohni tukwo n pirisiti aba jesnu ha ga anyaga n Mwusa ɓə tugbe ntu n əfye pmyapmya ɓo nyi, kwaa zè ɓəgbmi ga ɓa.” <verse eid="MRK 1:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 1:45" />Ama n əkwoɓwi, shi wo ɓə laka n ɓo wa ya ɓəda palala, woi gná nabagyi myi laɓa. Ntucenu, to Yeisu wa shna myi woi ló əzhi lo ai gye wo m, ama waa kpegnyi n aba ń aza to lo m. Dudulonu aza ɓa du ɓa ɓe da wo ɓai kwnu n ɓwahoɓwahoi.<verse eid="MRK 1:45" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="MRK 2" />
  <para style="s1">Yeisu ká nayi-fyifyiyida gna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 2:1" />N anyipyei fyewyi avnu, Yeisu wa je lodna n Kapanam, aza ɓa kwu wo nge wo la zhi apyi. <verse eid="MRK 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 2:2" />Aza bəgyé kwokwo ɓa yezhi to ai ɓwa aba ń a ɓa zhi apita m, kwo zhi ń abwokwnumi akpemi m, jesnu wa zhni ɓa waazi. <verse eid="MRK 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 2:3" />Aza ngwnu-anyi ɓa ɓe wo n nayi-fyifyiyidai. <verse eid="MRK 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 2:4" />Shikwonyi ɓa to ɓə ɓwa zokwo ń ɓa ɓá si n woi ń Yeisu aba m, ntu deeji ɓo, ɓa bma nyakwnusni tukwo, aba n Yeisu ɓə gnyi nyi, ɓa bma kwo əɓwo shni ncei jesnu ɓa shni n pəcei ń nyasnai ɓə tu nyi. <verse eid="MRK 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 2:5" />She Yeisu ɓə gye əɓa gaiciyaganunui, wa gna nayi-fyifyiyida yi, “Nugwnu, a kwu əho aleifyi zo ho.”<verse eid="MRK 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 2:6" />Nsayi owa anyawuyi ho ɓə sase kpe n abaayi, ɓa zhni ɓənubwo fyi n əɓa mi, <verse eid="MRK 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 2:7" />“Knyiyi nu zhni əza ye woi daɓo nlai a? Wo gnyi woi da atukwopmi əɓo nu! Nyika nu ɓa myi wa zo aleifyi ń Shekwoyi nu to ɓwasnu ma a?”<verse eid="MRK 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 2:8" />Nsayisayii, Yeisu wa kwu kpe dna n əwo zafnu nge əɓo nu nyi n ɓa zhi ɓai zhni kwo nubwo fyi ń əɓa adu, jesnu wa gna ɓa, “Knyiyi nu zhni fyei zhni aɓo ye pya nubwo a? <verse eid="MRK 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 2:9" />Knyidei nu gna wo lo faafa: a gna nayi-fyifyiyida ye, ‘A kwu əho aleifyi zo ho,’ kwo a gna, ‘Laka, kwu əho pəce ha znazna a’? <verse eid="MRK 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 2:10" />Ama mi ncei pmalo fya kwu kpe nge Əza Nugwnu n ikwoi lo dna ń anyì wa zo aleifyi.” Ntulonu wa gna əza ń nayi ɓə n woi fyifyiyi nyi ge, <verse eid="MRK 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 2:11" />“Mi gna ho, laka, kwu əho pəce ha lo əho pwuwa.” <verse eid="MRK 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 2:12" />Wa laka gnyiagnyi wa kwu əwo pəce wa znazna lo ɓai gye wo əwye vnyanya. Dəye kwa ga zahozahoyi ɓəwowo, ɓa ci Shekwoyi, ɓai gna, “Yi too shni ɓəye pya gye nlai m!”<verse eid="MRK 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeisu yi Levyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 2:13" />Njesnu Yeisu wa gbmiya lo nuwna-znudna əgbe. Deeji yaakwo kwa ɓe da wo, wa ya ɓa nyawu. <verse eid="MRK 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 2:14" />Shi wo ɓə lo woi znazna, wa gye Levyi Alfyis nugwnu n sasetu ń agədu gwoyi lubwi. Yeisu wa gna wo, “Vyi mi.” Levyi wa laka gnyi, wa vyi wo.<verse eid="MRK 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 2:15" />Əsa ń Yeisu ɓə tu woi gyi wyeshenyagyi dna n Levyi pwuwa, agədu gwoyi bəgyé n aleifyidai ɓa kwnu nyagyi gyi n woi ɓədo n əwo amwutuyii, ntuge ɓa ɓə mwa bəgyé ń ɓa ɓə vyi wo nyi. <verse eid="MRK 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 2:16" />She owa anyawuyi n ɓa ɓə zhni Afarisiyi nyi, ɓə gye woi kwnu nyagyi gyi n aleifyidai ɓədo n agədu gwoyii, ɓa nya əwo amwutuyi əɓo: “Knyiyi nu zhni woi kwnu nyagyi gyi n agədu gwoyii ɓədo n aleifyidai a?”<verse eid="MRK 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 2:17" />Shi Yeisu ɓə wo ɓəye wa gna ɓa, “Lafyiyada ta zna shigbeda shni m, ama nyasnayi. Mi to ɓe ma yi aɓəfyeceyi nu m, ama aleifyida.”<verse eid="MRK 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">A nya Yeisu əɓo ntu n əgbewna ɓo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 2:18" />Nsayi Yohana amwutuyi n Afarisiyi anyai, ɓa ɓə zhni ɓai wnagbe. Azaho ɓa ɓe ɓa nya Yeisu əɓo, “Kwo ze n wunanu Yohana ɓədo n Afarisiyi amwutuyii ɓai wnagbe, ama to əho amwutuyi ɓai wnagbe m ma?”<verse eid="MRK 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 2:19" />Yeisu wa dnaɓəgbe, “Kwo ɓa yezhni n wunanu mwulaɓa azhiɓeyi ɓa wnagbe woi ye kwnusnu n ɓai a? Ɓa taa wnagbe, əsa ń ɓa ye ɓwa kwnusnu lo n woi m. <verse eid="MRK 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 2:20" />Ama əsa ɓə lo, she a ɓə la mwulaɓa la ń əɓa aba, dna n nyipyeii nu ń ɓa ɓə wnagbe.<verse eid="MRK 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 2:21" />“Əzaho to lo n wo gwu əje-kwokwoi əta ǹ əje-woiwoyi m. N wa zhni lonu, əje-woiwoyi ɓa kpeya n kwokwoi, kwoi zhni sasaya kwoi la gna wu. <verse eid="MRK 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 2:22" />Jesnu əzaho to lo ń wo ze anamnuwna woiwoi fyi n anamnuwna apa-pwakwnu kwokwoi m. N wa zhni lonu anamnuwna woiwoi ɓə la apa-pwakwnu kwokwoi knyiapo ya, jesnu anamnuwna n anamnuwna apa-pwakwnui ɓa ɓə kwu zhniagbma. Aawo a ze anamnuwna woiwoi fyi n anamnuwna apa-pwakwnu woiwoi nu.”<verse eid="MRK 2:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeisu nu zhni Sibyiwyi Dagayi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 2:23" />N Sibyiwyi hoi, Yeisu woi duya dnalo n alikamazhni, jesnu əwo amwutuyi ɓai kwnu znazna n woi, ɓa ya alikama atukwo bma. <verse eid="MRK 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 2:24" />Afarisiyi ɓa gna wo, “Shiawye, knyiyi nu zhni ɓai zhni əɓo n kwo zhni owa gnanaznu n Sibyiwyi a?”<verse eid="MRK 2:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 2:25" />Wa dnaɓəgbe, “Fye too shni ba kpeekpe, ənya n Dawuda ɓə zhni əsa ń myikwnu ɓə gwnu wo n əwo anugwnudoi, jesnu ɓai fyi ń əsnagyi m? <verse eid="MRK 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 2:26" />Fyi n Abyiyata pirisiti tukwoda anyipyei, wa lodna ń Shekwoyi pwuwa, wa gyi biledi pmyapmyai, n kwo ɓə ɓwa apirisiti nya nu zhni ɓa gyi ngye shi owa ncei da nyi. Jesnu waa ce ga əwo anugwnudo.”<verse eid="MRK 2:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 2:27" />Nlonu wa gna ɓa, “A ɓə zhni Sibyiwyi ntu zanyikwoci ɓo nu, toge zanyikwoci ntu Sibyiwyi ɓo m. <verse eid="MRK 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 2:28" />Ntulonu Əza Nugwnu nu zhni Dagayi, du ɓədo tu n Sibyiwyi.”<verse eid="MRK 2:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="MRK 3" />
  <para style="s1">Yeisu ká əza gna n Sibyiwyii.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 3:1" />Dna n əsado, Yeisu wa lodna ń Ayahudiyibwokwnu, əza ɓə dna ń ɓo n əɓwai sháshái. <verse eid="MRK 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 3:2" />Azaho n ɓa, ɓə zna əɓo nu shni n ɓa ɓá ɓwa nabai ɓa tu Yeisu, ntulonu ɓa dna wo əwye byiwuu, nabai ɓa gye kwo wo ɓa ka wo gna n Sibyiwyii. <verse eid="MRK 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 3:3" />Yeisu wa gna əɓwa shasháida, “La laka gnyi n zahozahoyi abye.”<verse eid="MRK 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 3:4" />Nlonu Yeisu wa nya ɓa əɓo, “Knyiɓei nu ń owa ncei ye a zhni n Sibyiwyi a; a zhni ɓəmanai nu kwo ɓənukwoi, a gnyi wyewyeyi nu, kwo a wu kwo a?” Ama ɓa kwu cepyi.<verse eid="MRK 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 3:5" />Wa shi ɓa awye n minagyii waa shegwnu, cei sna wo ntu əɓa adu akalákpe ɓo, wa gna əza yi, “Ta əho əɓwa ya.” Wa ta kwo ya, əwo əɓwa kwaa tace n nunui. <verse eid="MRK 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 3:6" />Nlonu, Afarisiyi ɓa kwnuya lo ɓa ya kwúlupa n Ahirudiyii, she ɓa ɓá myi ɓa wu Yeisu.<verse eid="MRK 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Deeji vyi Yeisu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 3:7" />Yeisu wa zhaya lo nuwna-znudna n kwnusnu əwo amwutuyii, jesnu deeji yaakwo ɓa kwnu n Gəlili əknyi Yahudiya nya, ɓa vyi wo. <verse eid="MRK 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 3:8" />Shi ɓa ɓə wo aɓo vnyanya n wo ɓə gnyi woi zhni nyi, aza bəgyé ɓa kwnuɓe da wo ɓai kwnu n Yahudiya, Urishelima, Idumyinya, jesnu n asəpai ń ɓa kpe n Urudu əkpma dəyi n shé Taya gwnu ɓədo n Sidoni nyi. <verse eid="MRK 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 3:9" />Wa gna əwo amwutuyi nge ɓa zna əya ɓyiyi shni ga wo, ntu n deeji ɓo, nabai to aza ɓa nyi wo əpma m. <verse eid="MRK 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 3:10" />Ntuge wo ɓə la bəgyé kágna, ntulonu aza yi n ɓa ɓə zhi n anyasnai nyi, ɓa knyi aje aɓwaya lo n abyei nabai ɓa to wo əɓwa. <verse eid="MRK 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 3:11" />Əsahosahoi n azafnu ajegbmiyi gye wo əwye ncei, ɓa yazhi n əwo abye ɓa fyiakwu, “Əho nu zhni Shekwoyi Nugwnu.” <verse eid="MRK 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 3:12" />Ama waa əgbe tu ɓa n əwyei bmyibmyii nge ɓa to gna azaje əwo əɓo m.<verse eid="MRK 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeisu tnu atnutnuloyi awoceaba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 3:13" />Yeisu wa gwnulo əpe səpa, wa yì aza yi zhi n wo ɓə n əɓa ɓəi pma, jesnu ɓa ɓe da wo. <verse eid="MRK 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 3:14" />Wa tnu awoceaba, wa yì ɓa nge atnutnuloyi, nabai ɓa kwu kwnusnu n woi, n wo ɓə myi wa tnu ɓa waazizhni <verse eid="MRK 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 3:15" />jesnu ai ga ɓa ikwo ɓa kwnu ase ya.<verse eid="MRK 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="lh">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 3:16" />Aza awoceaba aye nu nyi ń wo ɓə tnu:</para>
  <para style="b" vid="MRK 3:16" />
  <para style="li1" vid="MRK 3:16">Sima (əza ń wo ɓə tu wo əye ge Byitusu),<verse eid="MRK 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 3:17" />Jemyis, Zebədi nugwnu ɓədo n əwodoi Yohana (wa kpe ɓa aye nge, Bwonajis, n əkwo nu gyi nge “əgbmawyisa anugwnu”),<verse eid="MRK 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 3:18" />Anduru,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="MRK 3:18">Fyilibwus,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="MRK 3:18">Batolomyi,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="MRK 3:18">Matiyu, Toma,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="MRK 3:18">Jemyis Alfyis nugwnu,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="MRK 3:18">Tadiyos,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="MRK 3:18">Sima Ziloti<verse eid="MRK 3:18" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 3:19" />ɓədo n Yahuda Iskariyotii, əza n wo ɓə ɓwu Yeisu nyi.<verse eid="MRK 3:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeisu n Byelzebwului</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 3:20" />Nlonu Yeisu wa lodna n pwuwa, njesnu deeji kwa yezhi, kwa zhni wo n əwo amwutuyii to ɓa myi ɓa shna nyagyi gyi m. <verse eid="MRK 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 3:21" />Shi əwo apwuwada ɓə wo əɓəye, ɓa lo ntuge ɓəə la wo lo ncei n əɓa pwuwa, ntuge ɓa ɓə gna, “Tukwo n la wo pmyi.”<verse eid="MRK 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 3:22" />Jesnu owa anyawuyi n ɓa ɓə kwnu n Urishelima nyi ɓa gna, “Byelzebwulu zafnu nu dna n wo! N ase tukwoda əbeɓyii nu n wo kwnu ase ya ncei.”<verse eid="MRK 3:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 3:23" />Ntulonu Yeisu wa yì ɓa wa daɓo n ɓai n aɓəsisii: “Shetam ɓa gbmi Shetam ya n wunanu a? <verse eid="MRK 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 3:24" />N əbemi kwo la əkwohni gnajeya, əbemi yi taa myignyi m. <verse eid="MRK 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 3:25" />N pwuwa kwo la əkwohni gnajeya, pwuwa yi taa myignyi m. <verse eid="MRK 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 3:26" />Jesnu ngye Shetam gnyiapaapa lo n əwohnii, wo la gnajeya nu, wo taa myignyi m, əwo nya kwo kwu zoo nu. <verse eid="MRK 3:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 3:27" />Ɓəhnihni, əzaho to lo n wo ɓa lodna n kaláda pwuwa, wa kwu əwo akaya, akpəge kpmisnui wo la əza kaláda pashi nu kpa. Nlonu n wo ɓa myi wa kwu akaya n əwo pwuwa. <verse eid="MRK 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 3:28" />Ɓəhnihni mi gna fye, a ɓa zo aza əɓa aleifyi vnyanya ɓədo n əyewnuya dəhodəhoi, <verse eid="MRK 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 3:29" />ama zahozahoyi n wa da atukwopmi ɓəda tu n Zafnu Gyigyiyi tukwo, a taa zo wo aleifyi m kpeekpe; ɓa n leifyi ɓəgyii lo nyalonyalo nya.”<verse eid="MRK 3:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 3:30" />Wo ɓə da dəye ntuge ɓa ɓə zhi ɓai gna, “Wo n zafnu ajegbmii dnalo nu.”<verse eid="MRK 3:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 3:31" />Nlonu Yeisu əya n əwo azajei ɓa si abaayi. Ɓa kwu zhi n əbmyi, ɓa tnu əzaho nge wo lo əmi wo yi wo ɓe ncei. <verse eid="MRK 3:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 3:32" />Deeji ɓə sase zhi n shegwnu wo, ɓa gna wo, “Əho əya n əho azajei, ɓa zhi lo n əbmyi, ɓa ye lo ɓa gye ho əwye.”<verse eid="MRK 3:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 3:33" />Wa nya, “Anyikado nu zhni əmi əya n əmi azaje a?”<verse eid="MRK 3:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 3:34" />Nlonu wa shi aza awye n ɓa ɓə sase zhi n shegwnu wo nyi, wa gna, “Əmi əya n əmi azajei nu zhi nyi! <verse eid="MRK 3:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 3:35" />Əzahozahoyi n wo zhni Shekwoyi ɓəye, əwo nu zhni əmizado, əmi mapwii n əyai.”<verse eid="MRK 3:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="MRK 4" />
  <para style="s1">Ɓəsisi nyabyeyi nya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 4:1" />Njesnu Yeisu wa ya nyawu ma ń nuwna-znudna əgbe. Deeji ń kwo ɓə yezhi n shegwnu wo nyi, kwo ɓə mwabəgyé, kwa zhni wo wa lodna n əya nuwnanya, waa sase dna n kwo tu n nuwna-znudna. Aza vnyanya ɓə ma lo ncei n nuwnagbe. <verse eid="MRK 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 4:2" />Wa wunya n mwabəgyé n aɓəsisii, jesnu dna n əwo nyawu wa gna: <verse eid="MRK 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 4:3" />“Fye knatnubwa! Fwanuyi ɓə gbmiya lo wo bye əwo nyabye. <verse eid="MRK 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 4:4" />Shi wo ɓəə lo woi she nyabye, adəho ɓa kaya zhi lo ncei ń zokwo, alú ɓa ɓe ɓa kwu ɓa gyi. <verse eid="MRK 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 4:5" />Adəho ɓa kaya kpe ń apmatala aba ń kwo to ɓə n amwii kpe n mwa m. Ɓa pa n pyeepye ntuge, amwii to ɓə loloi m. <verse eid="MRK 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 4:6" />Ama she nyipyei ɓə kpeɓe əkwo wowo kwa zhni ɓa kwu ɓwaa, ntuge ɓa to ɓə n agbegyei sassayii m. <verse eid="MRK 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 4:7" />Nyabye dəho kwa kaya fyi ń aknawui, aknawui ɓa mwa ɓaa kwo gyice, ntulonu anyanunui to ɓə ma atukwo m. <verse eid="MRK 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 4:8" />Dudulonu nyabye dəho kwa kaya fyi ń əknyi manai. Kwa pa, kwa mwa, jesnu kwa ma atukwo, kwa fyiawye, adəho shiita, adəho shiitnanyi, adəho tagyi she a ɓə bye.”<verse eid="MRK 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 4:9" />Nlonu Yeisu wa gna, “Zahozahoyi ń wo n atnubwai lo, akpəge wo wo.”<verse eid="MRK 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 4:10" />She wo ɓə gnyi əwo gbmanyi, əwo amwutuyi Awoceaba ɓədo n azajei ń ɓa ɓə kwnusnu n woi, ɓa nya wo əɓo ntu aɓəsisi ye ɓo. <verse eid="MRK 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 4:11" />Wa gna ɓa, “A kwu aɓo aɓwuɓwui Shekwoyi əbemi nya ga fye. Ama n aza yi aba n ɓa zhi n əshebemi əbmyi nyi, a da ɓa ɓəhoɓəhoi n aɓəsisii nu <verse eid="MRK 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 4:12" />nabai,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 4:12">“ ‘Ɓa ɓá gwodu ɓai gyewye ama ɓa taa ɓwa kwo awyega m kpeekpe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 4:12">jesnu ɓa ɓá gwodu ɓai wo ama ɓa ta kpé əkwo gənyi m kpeekpe;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 4:12">ntolonu m, ɓa ɓá myi ɓa pmyiɓe jesnu a zo ɓa abwi!’ ”<verse eid="MRK 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 4:13" />Nlonu Yeisu wa gna ɓa, “Fye too ɓwa ɓəsisi ye awyega m? To, fye ɓa ɓwa ɓəsisi dəhodəhoi awyega n wunanu a? <verse eid="MRK 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 4:14" />Fwanuyi bye ɓədagbma nu. <verse eid="MRK 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 4:15" />Azaho ń wulo ngye nyabye nu n kwo ɓə zhi lo ncei ń zokwo, aba n a bye ɓədagbma dna nyi. She ɓa ze n kwo wowoi, Shetam wa ɓe wa kwnu ɓədagbma n a ɓə bye fyi ń ɓa nyi. <verse eid="MRK 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 4:16" />Azaje, ngye nyabye n a ɓə bye kpe n apmatala, ɓa wo ɓədagbma jesnu n əsagbmanyii ɓa gwo kwo n agbmadai. <verse eid="MRK 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 4:17" />Ama shikwonyi ɓa to n agbegyei lo m, ɓa ta mwasa m. She azhnìgye kwo awyesnugbegye ɓo ɓe ntu ɓədagbma ɓo, ɓaa pye n myiyai. <verse eid="MRK 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 4:18" />Dudulonu azaje, ngye nyabye ń a ɓə bye kwo fyi ń aknawui nu nyi, ɓa wo ɓədagbma; <verse eid="MRK 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 4:19" />ama aɓəsa anyìgyi ye nya, n nyaɓwa akwocedna nyai ɓədo n anyapwawo anyaaje anyai, ɓa lo ɓe jesnu ɓaa ɓədagbma gyice, ɓa zhni to kwa ga gyigyi m. <verse eid="MRK 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 4:20" />Azaje ngye nyabye n a ɓə bye kwo fyi n əknyi manai nyi, ɓa wo ɓədagbma, ɓa gwo kwo, jesnu ɓa ga gyigyi; adəho shiita, adəho shiitnanyi, adəho tagyi aɓwa bəgyé shi a ɓə bye kwo.”<verse eid="MRK 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Pyitila tu n əkwo kwnuyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 4:21" />Wa gna ɓa, “Fye wna pyitila əná fyaa kwo kwnu papa nu, kwo fyaa kwo ya dna n gədo snuta a? N əkwoɓwi, fye ta tu kwo n əkwo kwnuyi nu m? <verse eid="MRK 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 4:22" />Ntuge nyahonyahoi n kwo ɓwushi lo, kwo shi ai gbmi kwo wu n əbmyi nu, jesnu nyahonyahoi n kwo pwuanya shi lo, kwo shi ai kpe kwo anya ya nu. <verse eid="MRK 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 4:23" />Ndəi ngye əza n atnubwai lo wa wo, akpəge wo wo.”<verse eid="MRK 4:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 4:24" />Wa gwodu, “Zhni ɓənubwo pəceye əɓo n fya wo. Nyamwinya n fya zhni apma ncei, əkwo nu n a ɓə mwu ga fye ncei; kwo n dudu ɓo. <verse eid="MRK 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 4:25" />Zahozahoyi n wo ncei lo, a ɓə la ɓə wo; zahozahoyi ń wo to ncei lo m, kwo ədo ń wo ncei lo, a ɓə la kwo gwo wo.”<verse eid="MRK 4:25" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɓəsisi nyabye mwamwai nya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 4:26" />Njesnu wa gna, “Shekwoyi əbemi n wu lo nlai nu. Əza ɓə she nyabye zhi n əknyi. <verse eid="MRK 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 4:27" />Nyipyei n sukwoi, kwo woi wnagye kwo woi kwnu-agyewyi nu, nyabye pa, jesnu kwoi mwa, kwo shikwonyi wo ta kpe she kwo zhnizhni m. <verse eid="MRK 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 4:28" />Əknyi n əkwohnii nu zhni əwyi kwa pa: kpmisnuyi əwyignai, nlonu kwa ma tukwo, nlonu əwyi byegye kwa kwokwo gyi n wyizhni. <verse eid="MRK 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 4:29" />Əsa n shewyi ze n ɓyiɓyii, wa tu ɓa lumizhegye, ntuge afwanyakwu əsa kwo la si.”<verse eid="MRK 4:29" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɓəsisi musta byegye nya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 4:30" />Njesnu wa gna, “Yi ɓa gna nge Shekwoyi əbemi wulo n wunanu a, kwo knyi ɓəsisii pya nu, n yi ɓa zhni apma ncei, ya wu she kwo lo a? <verse eid="MRK 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 4:31" />Kwo wulo ngye musta byegye nu, n kwo nu du n gbàgbà n anyabye vnyanya dna n anyì. <verse eid="MRK 4:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 4:32" />Dudulonu əsa ń a bye kwo ncei, kwo mwa kwaa zè əkna shnuwna duduyi n aɓwala yaakwoi, alui ɓwa aba ɓai yakpe ɓai snu ofnu.”<verse eid="MRK 4:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 4:33" />N aɓəsisi ajei nu nlai, n Yeisu ɓə da əɓəgbma ga ɓa, she ɓa ɓə ɓa myi ɓa ɓwa awyega. <verse eid="MRK 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 4:34" />Wo to ɓə da ɓəhoɓəhoi n ɓai ntna apmazhni n ɓəsisi m. Ama she wo cegnyi n kwnusnu n əwo amwutuyii, wa wu ɓa ɓəhoɓəhoi awyega.<verse eid="MRK 4:34" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeisu wo la agbmaase nazhi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 4:35" />N əwyi yii, she wyeshe ɓə la she, wa gna əwo amwutuyi, “Yii piyalo əkpma dəyi” <verse eid="MRK 4:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 4:36" />Shi wo ɓə fa deeji zhi n avnu, ɓa la wo, shi wo ɓə ɓwagnyi nyi, ɓa lo wo dna n əya n kwnusnu n əɓahnii. Aya nunwanya aje ce ɓə kwnusnu n woi. <verse eid="MRK 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 4:37" />Əse kaláda kwa laka gnyi, jesnu nuwna-adokwo ɓa shefyi n əya nuwnanya, kwo ɓə ɓwace ceewyi nu kwa shni. <verse eid="MRK 4:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 4:38" />Yeisu ɓə dna n əya avnu woi wnagye tu n agyewna aba. Amwutuyi ɓa kwnu wo agyewyiya ɓa gna wo, “Nyawuyi, ho ta gye əho anuwna lo n ya ɓwunuwna m?”<verse eid="MRK 4:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 4:39" />Wa laka gnyiagnyi, wa gnaknyi əse jesnu wa gna nuwna-adokwo, “Fye kwu cepyi!” Nlonu əse kwaa wnagnyi jesnu abaayi vnyanya ɓa cegnyi pyipyipyi.<verse eid="MRK 4:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 4:40" />Wa gna əwo amwutuyi, “Knyiyi nu zhni fyei wodna nsnu nlai a? Nya nsaiye fye too du fye ɓwa gaiciyanunui m?”<verse eid="MRK 4:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 4:41" />Ədna yaakwo kwa wo ɓa jesnu ɓa nya aje aɓo, “Nyika nu gnyi n əwoi a? Kwo əse n nuwna-adokwoi ɓa vyi əwo ɓəgbetu lo!”<verse eid="MRK 4:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="MRK 5" />
  <para style="s1">Yeisu wo la ase-nyasnayi kágna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 5:1" />Ɓa pi nuwna-znudna ya kpe n Ageraseniyi əknyi. <verse eid="MRK 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 5:2" />She Yeisu ɓə gbmi shi n əya nuwnanya, əza ń zafnu ajegbmii dna n wo, wa gbmiɓe ń avnyigwo wa shegwnu wo. <verse eid="MRK 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 5:3" />Əza ye ɓə dna ń avnyigwo nu, jesnu əza to ɓə ye nyi woi myi n wo pa, kwo n agbmai n shnasnu m. <verse eid="MRK 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 5:4" />Ntuge a ɓə zhni ai fyi wo agbma ciici n aɓwa ɓədo n apitai, ama woi gbé agbma ya jesnu woi ce asnukna ya n ɓa fyi n əwo apita nyi. Əzaho to ɓə nyi n akalái fyi n kwnuce wa myi n əwo ɓo m. <verse eid="MRK 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 5:5" />Wo ɓə dna laɓa n avnyigwo nu n sukwoi n nyipyeii, woi gwnu əpe kwnukwnù woi fyiakwu jesnu woi kpe əwohni aci n akwutai.<verse eid="MRK 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 5:6" />She wo ɓə gye Yeisu n tagnyi, wa bwusi lo da wo jesnu wa ceakwokwo shi ń wo abye. <verse eid="MRK 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 5:7" />Wa ɓəwyi n bəgye kalái, “Yeisu, Shekwoyi Nugwnu Duduyi, ho ye knyiɓei nu n əmi aba a? Ntu Shekwoyi ɓo, to tu mi azhnì m!” <verse eid="MRK 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 5:8" />Ntuge Yeisu ɓəi kwu gna zafnu ajegbmiyi, “Gbmiya ɓe n əza ye!”<verse eid="MRK 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 5:9" />Nlonu Yeisu wa nya wo əɓo, “A yi ho əye nge nanu a?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 5:9">Wa dnaɓəgbe, “A yi mi nge Bəgyé, ntuge yi mwabəgyé lo.” <verse eid="MRK 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 5:10" />Nlonu wa ɓa Yeisu woi je wo ɓa, nge wo to kwnu ɓa ya ń abaayi m.<verse eid="MRK 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 5:11" />Abwulutu gəluce yaakwo ɓə kpe ɓai gyi anyagyi vyivyiwyi ń əpe kwnukwnù. <verse eid="MRK 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 5:12" />Ase ɓa ɓa Yeisu, “Tnu n yii fyi n abwulutu; fa ya lofyi n ɓa.” <verse eid="MRK 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 5:13" />Wa ga ɓa əgbe, jesnu azafnu ajegbmiyi ɓa kwnuya ɓa lofyi n abwulutu. Abwulutu gəluce yi ɓə nyi ngye adugwu-aba nu, ɓa bwusi shnilo n agəgyigəgyii ɓa kaya fyi n nuwna-znudna ɓa kwu ɓwunuwna.<verse eid="MRK 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 5:14" />Abwulutu knayi ɓa bwusi ɓa lo ɓa wu alafyiya ye n əzhimi n azhigbai, jesnu aza bəgyé ɓa kwnulo, ɓəə gye əɓo n kwo ɓəə kwu zhni nyi. <verse eid="MRK 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 5:15" />She ɓa ɓə ɓe da Yeisu, ɓa gye əza ń ase bəgyé ɓə fyi n əwo nyi, woi sase shi ɓo, n ajei kpe jesnu n dna n əwohni ací; ədna kwa wo ɓa. <verse eid="MRK 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 5:16" />Aza yi n ɓa ɓə kwu gye shi kwo ɓə zhni əza n ase ɓə fyi n wo nyi, ɓa wu ɓa alafyiya ɓədo n abwulutu nyai. <verse eid="MRK 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 5:17" />Nlonu aza ɓa ya Yeisu ɓa nge wo la əɓa əknyi fa.<verse eid="MRK 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 5:18" />Shi Yeisu ɓə gnyi woi lodna n əya nuwnanya, əza n ase ɓə fyi n wo nyi, wa tna wo aɓwa nge wo fa wo wa kwnulo n woi. <verse eid="MRK 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 5:19" />To Yeisu wa ye wo m, ama wa gna wo, “Lo apyi da əho aza, ho gna ɓa she Dagayi wo kwu əɓo zhni ga ho nsnu, jesnu she wo ɓə gye ho snusnu.” <verse eid="MRK 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 5:20" />Ntulonu əza yi wa laka, wa ya woi da nabagyi dna n Dekapolis, she Yeisu kwu aɓo zhni ga wo nsnu. Jesnu ca wo aza vnyanya.<verse eid="MRK 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Əɓyinyikwoi kalala n əfyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 5:21" />She Yeisu ɓə la je piya n əya nuwnanyai tu n nuwna-znudna əkpma dəyi, wo ye gnyi n nuwna-znudna əgbe, deeji yaakwo kwa yezhi n shegwnu wo. <verse eid="MRK 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 5:22" />Nlonu gbmanyi n Ayahudiyibwokwnu atukwoda, ai yi wo ge Yarus, wa ɓe n ɓo, shi wo ɓə gye Yeisu, wa taya shi ń əwo apitabwada. <verse eid="MRK 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 5:23" />Wa gyi wo əwye n əwyei bmyibmyii, “Əmi nyigwnu nawyii shi lo woi fyí. Sukwu ɓe ha to wo əɓwa nabai n wo ɓa ɓwa kágna jesnu wa gyianyì.” <verse eid="MRK 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 5:24" />Ntulonu Yeisu wa kwnulo n woi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 5:24">Deeji yaakwo kwa vyi wo, kwa shegwnu wo kwoi ye wo fnya. <verse eid="MRK 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 5:25" />Njesnu nyikwoza ho ɓə gnyi ń abaayi n amizheya nyasnai woi kwu aye ɓwa ngwnu-awoceaba. <verse eid="MRK 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 5:26" />Wo ɓəə kwu azhnì yaakwo gye fyi n ashigbeda bəgyé akwnu, woi kwu əwo nyaɓwa zo wuya vnyanya, dudulonu, to wa ɓwa kágna m, nyasna kwa ce kwa gna bwabwafyi nu. <verse eid="MRK 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 5:27" />Shi wo ɓə wo Yeisu ɓo, wa gbmiɓe n deeji wa ɓe wa gnyi n əwo avnu wa to wo əɓwa n əje, <verse eid="MRK 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 5:28" />ntuge wo ɓə zhni ɓənubwo, “Ndəi ń mi ɓaa əwo əje shni əɓwa toto, mi ɓa ɓwa kágna.” <verse eid="MRK 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 5:29" />Nsayisayii əwo amizheya ɓaa kpegnyi jesnu wa kwu əwo nayi wo ashna, nge wo la loloya ɓwa n əwo azhnìgye.<verse eid="MRK 5:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 5:30" />N əsagbmanyii, Yeisu wa kwu kpe nge kalá la gbmiya n wo. Wa pmyiawye dna n deeji wa nyaɓo, “Nyikanu naa to əmi əje əɓwa a?”<verse eid="MRK 5:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 5:31" />Əwo amwutuyi ɓa dnaɓəgbe, “Ho kwu gye aza ɓai yegye ho, hoi dudu hoi nyaɓo, ‘Nyika nu naa to əmi əje əɓwa a?’ ”<verse eid="MRK 5:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 5:32" />Ama Yeisu waa gnyi woi kawye laɓa, wa gye əza n wo nu ɓə zhni ɓəye nyi. <verse eid="MRK 5:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 5:33" />Nlonu nyikwoza yi woi kpe əɓo əye n kwo ɓəə kwu zhni wo nyi, wa ɓe, wa ceakwokwo shi n əwo apitabwada aba, woi vnyi n ədnai, wa gna wo gaiciya vnyanya. <verse eid="MRK 5:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 5:34" />Wa gna wo, “Nyigwnu, əho gaiciyaganunui kwo la ho kágna. Lo n bwugbafui, ho la loloya ɓwa n əho azhnìgye.”<verse eid="MRK 5:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 5:35" />Yeisu woi ye gnyi woi daɓo, azaho ɓa kwnuɓe n Yarus Ayahudiyibwokwnu tukwoda pwuwa. Ɓa gna wo, “Əho nyigwnu wo la fyí, knyiyi nu zhni hoi ye gna nyawuyi gnagná n shnasnu a?”<verse eid="MRK 5:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 5:36" />Woi wo əɓo n ɓa ɓə da nyi, Yeisu wa gna wo, “To wodna m; la gaiciya nu ɓwa ga.”<verse eid="MRK 5:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 5:37" />Wo to ɓə ye zahozahoyi nge wo vyi wo m, akpəge Byitusu, Jemyis n Yohanai, Jemyis zado. <verse eid="MRK 5:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 5:38" />She ɓa ɓə ɓe Ayahudiyibwokwnu tukwoda pwuwa, Yeisu wa gye aba n totu gnyi n wyiɓei, aza ɓai ciɓwi jesnu ɓai fyiakwu n akalái. <verse eid="MRK 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 5:39" />Wa lodna n pwuwa mi, wa gna ɓa, “Knyiyi nu zhni abaye n totu gnyi n akwufyii a? Əɓyi ye to fyí m, ama wo wnagye nu.” <verse eid="MRK 5:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 5:40" />Ama ɓa ma wo asnaɓwugyi nu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 5:40">Shi wo ɓə la ɓa kwnuya zhi n əbmyi vnyanya, wa la əɓyi dada n əɓyi əyai n amwutuyii n ɓa ɓə kwnusnu n woi nyi, ɓa lofyi n aba n əɓyi ɓə dna nyi. <verse eid="MRK 5:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 5:41" />Wa la əwo əɓwa shi wa gna wo, “Talitha koum!” (N əkwo nu gyi, “Əɓyinyikwoi, mi gna ho ge laka gnyiagnyi!”). <verse eid="MRK 5:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 5:42" />Nsaisayii əɓyinyikwoi wa laka gnyi wa ya znazna (wo ɓəə nyi aye awoceaba nu). Əɓo ye ca wo ɓa vnyanya dəidəi. <verse eid="MRK 5:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 5:43" />Wa tu əgbe n əwyei bmyibmyiyi nge, ɓa to ye əzaho wa kpe ɓəye əye m, jesnu wa gna ɓa nge ɓa ga wo nyaho wa gyi.<verse eid="MRK 5:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="MRK 6" />
  <para style="s1">Sheɓəgwognayi ntna mwamwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 6:1" />Yeisu wa fa abaayi wa lo əwo əzhi n kwnusnu n wo amwutuyii. <verse eid="MRK 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 6:2" />She Sibyiwyi ɓə si, wa ya nyawu dna n Ayahudiyibwokwnu, jesnu ca wo aza bəgyé n ɓa ɓə kna wo ɓədagbma tnubwa nyi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:2">Ɓa nyaɓo, “Əza ye ɓə ɓwa aɓo ye n nanu a? Knyi wyemwai nu nyi n a la ga wo a? Knyi atuzè yaakwo nu n wo gnyi woi zhni nyi a? <verse eid="MRK 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 6:3" />Əza ye nu to zhni kafyinta m? Əwo nu to zhni Mariyamwu nugwnu, Jemyis zado n Yusufui, Yahuda ɓədo n Simai m? Əwo amapwi to kwnusnu lo n yii n ya m?” Nlonu ɓaa əɓo ɓwa n woi.<verse eid="MRK 6:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 6:4" />Yeisu wa gna ɓa, “Sheɓəgwognayi to lo ntna mwamwa m, akpəge dna n əwohni əzhi, dna n əwohni azaje atasni jesnu n əwo pwuwai.” <verse eid="MRK 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 6:5" />To wa wu atuzè dəhodəhoi n ɓo m, akpəge əwo aɓwa n wo ɓə ɓwa kpe n anyasnayi fyewyi jesnu ɓa gwo kágna. <verse eid="MRK 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 6:6" />Ca wo wo she wo ɓə gye əɓa tnagaiciyaganunui.</para>
  <para style="s1" vid="MRK 6:6">Yeisu tnú Awoceaba tnutnu</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:6">Nlonu Yeisu wa zna laɓa woi wunya, woi vyi azhi gbmanyi, gbmanyi. <verse eid="MRK 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 6:7" />Wa yì ngwnu-awoceaba yi ga əwohni, wa ya ɓa tnutnu tnú əɓa ngwnu-aba, aba, wa ga ɓa ikwo tu n azafnu ajegbmiyi tukwo.<verse eid="MRK 6:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 6:8" />Aɓo ye nu ɓə zhni əwo aɓəgbega: “Fye to la nyahonyahoi ntu əzna ɓo m, akpəge bwusi, fye to la biledi, gwnuma, kwo gyiwye dna n əfye ashnipa nya m. <verse eid="MRK 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 6:9" />Fye kwu abwada fyi n apita, ama fye to kwu əjekpe baayi m. <verse eid="MRK 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 6:10" />Əsahosahoi n fya lofyi n pwuwa, fye kwu fyi n ɓo nya əsa n fye ɓa kwnu n əzhi yi. <verse eid="MRK 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 6:11" />Nlonu abahobahoi n ɓa to gwo fye kwo ɓa kna fye tnubwa m, fye kwnuya n abaayi, fya lu aɓwutukwnu ya n əfye apitabwada, kwaa zè ɓəgbmi tu n əɓa tukwo.”<verse eid="MRK 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 6:12" />Ɓa kwnuya ɓa lo ɓa zhni waazi nge aza ɓa yeabwi. <verse eid="MRK 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 6:13" />Ɓa kwnu ase ya n mwa bəgyé jesnu ɓa pmya anyasnayi bəgyé omi, ɓa ká ɓa gna.<verse eid="MRK 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yohana batizimazhniyi əfyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 6:14" />Əsu Hiridusu wa wo Yeisu əɓo ntuge əwo əye ɓəə la lapwi. Azaho ɓə zhi ɓai gna, “A la Yohana Batizimazhniyi nu laka n əfyi, cenuzhni ikwo atuzè nya ɓai vyi wo.”<verse eid="MRK 6:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 6:15" />Azaje ɓa gna, “Əwo nu zhni Iliya.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:15">Dudulonu, azaje ɓa gna, “Wo zhni sheɓəgwognayi nu, wo wulo ngye sheɓəgwognayi sapa nya ho nu.”<verse eid="MRK 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 6:16" />Ama shi Hiridusu ɓə wo ɓəye, wa gna, “Yohana, əza n mi ɓə kpe wo tukwo nyi, a la əwo nu laka n əfyi!”<verse eid="MRK 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 6:17" />Ntuge Hiridusu nu əwohni tukwoi n wo ɓə ga əgbe nge a wna Yohana, wa zhni a pa wo jesnu aa wo dna n zhalu. Wo ɓə zhni dəye ntu Hiriduya əɓo nu, əwodo Fyilibwus nyikwo, n wo ɓəə la wo gwo wo nyi. <verse eid="MRK 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 6:18" />Ntuge Yohana ɓə zhni woi gna Hiridusu, “Owa to ncei ye lo, ha la əho ədo nyikwo m.” <verse eid="MRK 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 6:19" />Ntulonu Hiriduya ɓə n nuwnui dna n Yohanai jesnu wo ɓə ncei pma wa wu wo. Ama to wa myi n wo wu m, <verse eid="MRK 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 6:20" />ntuge Hiridusu ɓə zhni woi wo Yohana ədna, woi kna wo, shikwonyi wo ɓə kpəge wo zhni ɓəfyeceyi nu jesnu əza gyigyiyi. She Hiridusu ɓə wo Yohana ɓəda, wa kwu jeje n mwa; dudulonu wo ɓə ncei pma wa kna wo ɓəda tnubwa.<verse eid="MRK 6:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 6:21" />N kpmasnu, Hiriduya bwugba ɓəmwi nunu əsa, kwa ɓe. N əwyii n Hiridusu mama nyipyei ɓə shegwnudo, Hiridusu wa yì awyefna ntu əwo atnutnuyi aza adnagbmai ɓo ɓədo n akwnuyi abəzhei jesnu n aza ayaakwoi ń Gəlili. <verse eid="MRK 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 6:22" />She Hiriduya nyigwnu ɓə lo ɓe wa nyanya, əkwo ɓo kwa kwu da Hiridusu ɓədo n əwo wyeshe nyagyi azhiɓeyii.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:22">Əsu wa gna əɓyinyikwoi yi, “Nya mi nyahonyahoi əɓo n ho ye jesnu mi ɓa ga ho kwo.” <verse eid="MRK 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 6:23" />Wa shi wo əɓəgbe n nyasíi, “Nyahonyahoi n ha nya mi əkwo ɓo, mi ɓa ga ho, kwo ngye əmi əbemi tokwnu nu.”<verse eid="MRK 6:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 6:24" />Wa gbmiya lo wa nya əwo əya, “Mi ɓa nya knyiyi nu ɓo a?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:24">Wa dna wo ɓəgbe, “Yohana Batizimazhniyi tukwo.”<verse eid="MRK 6:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 6:25" />N əsagbmanyii əɓyinyikwoi wa lo da əsu wolowolo wa gna wo: “Mi n cei pma nsaiye a ga mi Yohana Batizimazhniyi tukwo tu n fnyitala.”<verse eid="MRK 6:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 6:26" />Bwugba kwaa əsu wnu n mwa, ama ntu əwo nyasí ɓo ɓədo n əwo wyeshe nyagyi azhiɓeyii, to wa ye wa na wo əkwo əɓo m. <verse eid="MRK 6:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 6:27" />Ntulonu, nsayisayii əsu wa tnú əzawuyi n əgbei, nge wo ɓe n Yohana tukwoi. Əza yi wa lo wa kpe Yohana tukwo dna n zhalu, <verse eid="MRK 6:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 6:28" />jesnu wa ɓe n əwo tukwoi tu n fnyitala. Waa kwo ga əɓyinyikwoi yi, wa lo əwo əya ncei. <verse eid="MRK 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 6:29" />Shi Yohana amwutuyi ɓə wo nlonu, ɓa ɓe, ɓa la əwo nayi ɓaa kwo byidna n vnyigwo.<verse eid="MRK 6:29" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeisu ga aza adugwu–atnu nyagyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 6:30" />Atnutnuyi ɓa yezhi n shegwnu Yeisu jesnu ɓa wu wo aɓo vnyanya n ɓa ɓə kwu zhni n nyawui n ɓa ɓə wu. <verse eid="MRK 6:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 6:31" />Nlonu, ntuge aza bəgyé ɓə gnyi ɓai ɓe jesnu ɓai lo, ntucenu, to ɓa ɓwa əsa n ɓa ɓá gyi nyagyi m. Wa gna ɓa, “Fye vyi mi əfyehnifyehni ya lo aba n wyiɓe to lo m, yii kwu snu.”<verse eid="MRK 6:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 6:32" />Ntulonu ɓa kwuka əɓahniɓahni ɓa lofyi n əya nuwnanya ɓa lo aba n kwo ɓə gnyi pyipyipyi. <verse eid="MRK 6:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 6:33" />Ama aza bəgyé n ɓa ɓə gye ɓa ɓai kwuka ɓa kwu ɓa kpeye, ɓa bwusi lo n apitai ɓai kwnu n azhimi vnyanya jesnu ɓa kwu si n ɓo n əɓa abye. <verse eid="MRK 6:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 6:34" />Əsa n Yeisu ɓə gbmitu n əkpma wa gye deeji yaakwo, wa gye ɓa snusnu, ntuge ɓa ɓə zhi ngye aknyi nu ntna knayi. Ntulonu wa ya ɓa nyawu n mwa bəgyé.<verse eid="MRK 6:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 6:35" />Nsayii, wyeshe ɓə la she, ntulonu əwo amwutuyi ɓa ɓe da wo ɓa gna, “Zhabwi nu gnyi n ya, jesnu wyeshe n la lu she. <verse eid="MRK 6:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 6:36" />Gna aza ami nabai ɓa lo azhi n ɓa shegwnu laɓa nyi ɓədo n azhigbai ɓa lo ɓəə si nyagyi ga əɓahni ɓa gyi.”<verse eid="MRK 6:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 6:37" />Ama wa dnaɓəgbe, “Fye ga ɓa nyaho ɓa gyi.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:37">Ɓa gna wo, “Gye kwo ɓaa du gwodogwo gyiwye əye tokwnu nya ya! Yi ɓa lo yii wu gyiwye n snulai kpe biledi ntuge ya ga ɓa ɓá gyi?”<verse eid="MRK 6:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 6:38" />Wa nyaɓo, “Fye n biledi aknanai shi lo ngwnu aknyiyi nu a? Fye lo fye kawye.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:38">She ɓa ɓə kwu gyewye, ɓa gna, “Ngwnu-atnu nu n abmyai ngwnu-aba.”<verse eid="MRK 6:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 6:39" />Nlonu Yeisu wa ga ɓa əgbe nge ɓa gna aza vnyanya ɓa kwu sase n akwu-akwui kpe n agbegbe-pwutu. <verse eid="MRK 6:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 6:40" />Ntulonu ɓa kwu sase zhi n akwui, tagyi-tagyi nya ɓədo n shiitnu-shiitnu nyai. <verse eid="MRK 6:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 6:41" />Shi wo ɓə gwo biledi aknana ngwnu-atnu n abmyai ngwnu-aba yii wa kpe əwye wu n əshe, wa sa Shekwoyi ami jesnu wa sa biledi aknana yii ya. Nlonu wa ga əwo amwutuyi ɓa gnaya ga aza. Jesnu wa gna abmya ngwnu-aba yi ya fyi n əɓa vnyanya atasni. <verse eid="MRK 6:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 6:42" />Əɓa vnyanya ɓa gyi jesnu nubwo kwa kwu ɓa fwu <verse eid="MRK 6:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 6:43" />Amwutuyi ɓa kwu biledi n abmya awyiwoi, acekwnu ngwnu-awoceaba. <verse eid="MRK 6:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 6:44" />Azanugbai n ɓa ɓə gyi nyagyi yi nyi ɓa ɓə nyi adugwu-atnu nu.<verse eid="MRK 6:44" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeisu znazna tu n nuwna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 6:45" />Nsayisayii, Yeisu wa zhni əwo amwutuyi ɓa lofyi ń əya nuwnanya jesnu ɓa kwu gyilo n abye ɓai lo Betsaida, wo ɓəye cegnyi woi gna deeji ami. <verse eid="MRK 6:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 6:46" />Woi la laka n əɓa aba, wa gwnutu lo n əpe, wo zhniaduwa.<verse eid="MRK 6:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 6:47" />N əsado dna n sukwoi, əya ɓə dnalo n nuwna-znudna atasni, jesnu woi ce tu əwo gbmanyi n əkpma. <verse eid="MRK 6:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 6:48" />Wa gye amwutuyi fyi ɓai gyeazhnì n əya dna nyai, ntuge əse to ɓə ci ɓe n awyei ce n əya nuwnanya nu. N fyegyi ɓwai, wa lo da ɓa, woi znazna tu n nuwna-znudna. Wo ɓə ye wa du ɓa ya nu, <verse eid="MRK 6:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 6:49" />ama she ɓa ɓə gye wo woi znazna tu ń nuwna-znudna, ɓa zhninubwo nge wo zhni nyasnuɓwui nu. Ɓa fyiakwu, <verse eid="MRK 6:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 6:50" />ntuge əɓa vnyanya ɓə kwu wo gyewye jesnu ədna kwa kwu wo ɓa.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:50">Nsayisayii, wa daɓo n ɓai wa gna, “Fye kwu agwumyizhi! Əmi nu. Ədna to wo fye m.” <verse eid="MRK 6:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MRK 6:51" />Nlonu wa lodna n əya nuwnanya n kwnusnu n ɓai jesnu əse kwaa nazhi. Əɓo yi kwa wo ɓa n mwa kwokwo, <verse eid="MRK 6:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MRK 6:52" />ntuge ɓa to ɓəə ɓwa awyega biledi nya m; ntuge əɓa abwugba ɓəə kwu shni.<verse eid="MRK 6:52" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="MRK 6:53" />She ɓa ɓə la piya, ɓa kwnukpe n Genezareti əknyi jesnu ɓaa əya nunwanya gyima n ɓo. <verse eid="MRK 6:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MRK 6:54" />Shi ɓa ɓə zo n kakazhii n əya nunwanya, aza ɓa kwu Yeisu kpeye. <verse eid="MRK 6:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="MRK 6:55" />Ɓa zna laɓa n səpayi vnyanya ɓai kwu anyasnayi kpe n apəce ɓai lo abahobahoi n ɓa ɓə kwu wo nge wo gnyilo. <verse eid="MRK 6:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MRK 6:56" />Njesnu abahobahoi n wo ɓə la lo; azhi, azhimi kwo azhigba; ɓa ɓə la anyasnayi kwnuzhi n adubayaakwo. Ɓa ɓà wo nge wo fa ɓa to, kwo əwo əjegbe nu əɓwa, jesnu aza vnyanya n ɓa ɓə kwu kwo toɓwa nyi, ɓa kwu kágna ɓwa.<verse eid="MRK 6:56" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="MRK 7" />
  <para style="s1">Ənya n kwo tu əza cegye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 7:1" />Afarisiyi n owa anyawuyi hoi, n ɓa ɓəə kwnuɓe n Urishelima nyi, ɓa yezhi n shegwnu Yeisu <verse eid="MRK 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 7:2" />ɓa gye əwo amwutuyi ho ɓai gyi nyagyi n aɓwa cegyeii, n əkwo nu ge, ɓa to ɓə n aɓwai nanayi m. <verse eid="MRK 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 7:3" />(Afarisiyi ɓədo n Ayahudiyi vnyanya ɓa ta gyi nyagyi m, akpəge ɓa la aɓwana əɓa kwnunu nya, n azakwoi kwnunui shiɓwa wyiwuú. <verse eid="MRK 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 7:4" />Əsa n ɓa zhi n adubayaakwo, ɓa ta gyi nyagyi m akpəge ɓa la əɓa nayi zhnaya. Njesnu ɓai shi akwnunu aje bəgyé əɓwa, ngye abwoɓyiyi zhnaya, ashnapa ɓyiyi ɓədo n awyewnubwei.)<verse eid="MRK 7:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 7:5" />Ntulonu Afarisiyi n owa anyawuyii ɓa nya Yeisu, “Knyiyi nu zhni əho amwutuyi to ɓai gyianyì n vyi abyeda kwnunui ma, ama n əkwoɓwi ɓai gyi nyagyi n aɓwa acegyeii a?”<verse eid="MRK 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 7:6" />Wa dnaɓəgbe, “Ishaya ɓə dna n gaiciya əsa ń wo ɓə da sheɓəgwogna tu ń əfye ɓo akwocednayi; ngye shi kwo kafyilo:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 7:6">“ ‘Aza ye ga mi mwamwa n əɓa agbei nu ɓwasnu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 7:6">ama əɓa adu mwakpa lo n mii.<verse eid="MRK 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 7:7" />Ɓa ga mi mwamwa gbəloi nu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 7:7">əɓa nyawu ɓwa azanyikwoci aɓəgbekpe nu zhni.’<verse eid="MRK 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 7:8" />Fye kwu Shekwoyi aɓəgbetu ya, ama fye zhi n azanyikwoci akwnunui nu shiɓwa wyiwuú.”<verse eid="MRK 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 7:9" />Nlonu wa gwodu, “Fye n əgbái lo ń fye pmyi Shekwoyi ɓəgbetu shi n gnagna nabai fya kwu əfyehni akwnunu shiɓwa! <verse eid="MRK 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 7:10" />Ntuge Mwusa ɓə kwu gna, ‘Ga əho dada mwamwa ɓədo n əho əyai,’ jesnu, ‘Zahozahoyi n wa knyi əwo dada akpmi kwo əwo əya, ɓəshishinu a ɓa wu wo.’ <verse eid="MRK 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 7:11" />Ama fye gna lo nge n əza wa gna nge, ənya n əza ɓə ɓa zhni apma wa bma əwo dada zhni ncei kwo əwo əya kwo zhni Kwoban nu (əkwo nu nge, a la kwo ga dna n Shekwoyi akwnu), <verse eid="MRK 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 7:12" />nlonu to fya shna ye nge wo zhni ɓəhoɓəhoi ga əwo dada kwo əwo əya m. <verse eid="MRK 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 7:13" />N zokwo ye nu n fye la Shekwoyi ɓəda zè gbəloi n əfye akwnunui n fye kwu wu aɓyi nyi. Jesnu fyei zhni aɓo aje n mwa bəgyé nlonu.”<verse eid="MRK 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 7:14" />Njesnu Yeisu wa yì deeji ga əwohni jesnu wa gna, “Zahozahoyi n fye, wo kna mi tnubwa, jesnu fye ɓwa ɓəye awyega. <verse eid="MRK 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 7:15" />Nyaho to lo n əbmyi n kwaa lodna n əza əmi n kwo ɓa tu wo cegye m. N kwo əɓwi, ənya nu n kwo gbmiɓe n əza əmi n kwo tu əza cegye. [<verse eid="MRK 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 7:16" />Ndəi əza n wo atnubwai lo, akpəge wo wo.”]<verse eid="MRK 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 7:17" />She wo ɓə la laka n deeji aba wa lodna n apyimi, əwo amwutuyi ɓa nya wo əɓo ntu ɓəsisi ye ɓo. <verse eid="MRK 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 7:18" />Wa nya ɓa əɓo, “Fye ye fyilo ntna gənyikpe nu? Fye ta gyewye lo nge nyaho to lo n kwo gbmi n əbmyi kwa lodna n əza əmi n kwo ɓa tu əza cegye m? <verse eid="MRK 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 7:19" />Ntuge kwo ta lodna n əwo ədu nu m, ama n əwo nubwo nu, nlonu kwa gbmiya n nayi.” (N ɓəda yei, Yeisu ɓə gna nu nge, anyagyi vnyanya n gyigyii lo.)<verse eid="MRK 7:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 7:20" />Wa gwodu: “Ənya n kwo gbmiɓe n əza əmi nyi, əkwo nu tu əza cegye. <verse eid="MRK 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 7:21" />Ntuge fyi n əmi nù, dna n zanyikwoci ədu, n aɓonubwozhni anukwoi kwnuɓe: asisiɓozhni, əvyì, əzawu, <verse eid="MRK 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 7:22" />anagbái, əwye, ɓəshinmì, kwocedna, aɓənyashna, shewo, əyewnuya, tukwognanakwo ɓədo n amamaɓəzhni. <verse eid="MRK 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 7:23" />Aɓənukwoi ye vnyanya ɓa kwnuɓe n əmì nu, əɓa nu tu əza cegye.”<verse eid="MRK 7:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Sirofonishiyi nyikwoza gaiciyaganunui</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 7:24" />Yeisu wa fa abaayi wa lo aba n wo vyivyiwyi n Tayai. Wa lodna n pwuwa ama wo to ɓə ncei pma a kpe ce ye m; dudulonu wo to ɓə ye myi wa so əwohni n bəgyé aba m. <verse eid="MRK 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 7:25" />Ɓəhnihni, nyikwoza ho n əwo nyigwnu nawyii ɓəə shi n zafnu ajegbmiyii dna nyi, shi wo ɓə wo əwo əɓo, wa ɓe, wa she əwohni ya shi n əwo apita aba. <verse eid="MRK 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 7:26" />Nyikwoza yi ɓə zhni Girikiyi nu, n a ɓə ma wo n Fonishiya Siriya nya. Wa ɓà Yeisu nge wo gbmi əse ya n əwo nyigwnu.<verse eid="MRK 7:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 7:27" />Wa gna wo, “Kpmisnuyi, fa aɓyi ɓa kwu nyagyi gyi shi ɓa ncei pma, ntuge kwo to bmyalo a la aɓyi biledi a sheyashi amwi m.”<verse eid="MRK 7:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 7:28" />Nyikwoza yi wa dnaɓəgbe, “Dagayi, kwo amwi n ɓa zhi n tebwul snuta nyi, ɓa gyi aɓyi nyagyi awyiwoi.”<verse eid="MRK 7:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 7:29" />Nlonu wa gna nyikwoza yi, “Ntu ɓəgbedna ye pya ɓo, ho ɓa myi ha lo, əse kwo la gbmiya n əho nyigwnu.”<verse eid="MRK 7:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 7:30" />Nyikwoza yi wa lo əwo pwuwa wa gye əwo əɓyi n yatu n gədo, əse kwoi la gbmi n wo.<verse eid="MRK 7:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeisu ká tnubwagwunayi n takpeɓədayi gna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 7:31" />Nlonu Yeisu wa fa Taya əknyi wa duya n Sidon, woi shnilo Gəlili shikwo jesnu wa lodna n Dekapolis əknyi. <verse eid="MRK 7:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 7:32" />N abaayi azaho ɓa ɓe wo n əzai n wo ɓə zhni tnubwagwunayi jesnu ɓəda dai dna wo əɓo, ɓa ɓà Yeisu nge wo tu əza yi əwo əɓwa.<verse eid="MRK 7:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 7:33" />Shi wo ɓə la wo pmyiyagnyi n gnagna, n taya gnyi n deejii, Yeisu wa fyi əwo aɓwanyi n əza yi atnubwa. Nlonu wa knyiaknyi jesnu wa to əza yi nyitala əɓwa ncei. <verse eid="MRK 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 7:34" />Wa kpewyewu lo əshemi wa ya əsnu n mwa, wa gna wo, “Effata!” (N əkwo nu nge, “La gwuya!”) <verse eid="MRK 7:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 7:35" />N dəyei əza yi atnubwa ɓa gwuya, əwo nyitala kwaa loya jesnu wa ya ɓəda da ai wo kwo n kwnukwnuiya.<verse eid="MRK 7:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 7:36" />Yeisu wa ga ɓa ɓəgbetu nge ɓa to gna zahozahoyi m. Ama shi wo yi əwohni woi da lonu, aza ɓa gna əɓahni yiyi nu ɓai daɓo tu n kwo tukwo. <verse eid="MRK 7:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 7:37" />Aza ɓaa əgbe làya zhi vnyanya n ɓəwowoi. Ɓa gna, “Wo kwu ɓəhoɓəhoi zhni n bmya, woi zhni tnubwagwunayi woi wo ɓəda jesnu takpeɓəda woi daɓo.”<verse eid="MRK 7:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="MRK 8" />
  <para style="s1">Yeisu ga aza adugwu-anyi nyagyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 8:1" />Fyi n anyipyei yi, deeji yaakwo ədo kwaa yezhi. Shikwonyi ɓa to ɓəə n nyagyii shi n ɓa ɓá gyi m, Yeisu wa yì əwo amwutuyi zhi wa gna ɓa, <verse eid="MRK 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 8:2" />“Aza ye snusnu wna mi lo; ɓa kwu kwnusnu n mii anyipyei ngwnu-ata, ntna nyagyi. <verse eid="MRK 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 8:3" />N ma gna ɓa ami lo apyi n myikwnui, ɓa ɓá lo ɓai myiya lo ń zokwoi ntuge azaho ɓə kwnu n aba n kpaai nu.”<verse eid="MRK 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 8:4" />Əwo amwutuyi ɓa dnaɓəgbe, “Ama knyi abai nu lo n zhabwi ye n əzaho ɓa ɓwa biledi kwa kwnu ɓa gyi a?”<verse eid="MRK 8:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 8:5" />Yeisu wa nyaɓo, “Fye n biledi aknanai shilo ngwnu aknyiyi nu a?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 8:5">Ɓa dnaɓəgbe, “Ngwnu-tnaaba.”<verse eid="MRK 8:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 8:6" />Wa gna deeji nge ɓa kwu sase zhi n əknyi. She wo ɓəə la aknana ngwnu-tnaaba yi gwo, jesnu woi kwu Shekwoyi saami, wa sa kwo ya, wa ga əwo amwutuyi nge ɓa gnaya ga aza; jesnu ɓa kwo gnaya ga ɓa. <verse eid="MRK 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 8:7" />Ɓa ɓə n abmya aɓyii shi fyewyi ɓədo; wa kwu Shekwoyi saami ntu abmya ɓo ce, jesnu wa ga əwo amwutuyi ɓa gnaya ga aza. <verse eid="MRK 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 8:8" />Aza ɓa gyi jesnu nubwo kwa kwu ɓa fwu. N dəye avnu amwutuyi ɓa kwu awyiwoi n ɓa ɓə ce nyi, acekwnu n nunui, ngwnu-tnaaba. <verse eid="MRK 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 8:9" />Aza ɓə nyi ngye adugwu-anyi nu n ɓa ɓə zhi ń ɓo. Shi wo ɓə kwu ɓa gnami, <verse eid="MRK 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 8:10" />wa lodna ń əya nuwnanya n əwo amwutuyii ɓa lo Dalmanuta əknyi.<verse eid="MRK 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 8:11" />Afarisiyi ɓa ɓe, ɓa ya ɓai nya Yeisu aɓo. Ntuge ɓa tu wo mwi, ɓa nya wo əznù ɓo n kwo gbmi n əshemi. <verse eid="MRK 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 8:12" />Wa ya əsnu fnaa wa gna, “Knyiyi nu zhni cala ye kwoi nya əznù ɓo a? Ɓəhnihni əmi nu gna fye, a taa ga kwo əznù dəhodəhoi m.” <verse eid="MRK 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 8:13" />Nlonu wa fa ɓa, wa jezelo wa lodna n əya nuwnanya wa piyatu n əkpma dəyi.<verse eid="MRK 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Afarisiyi yisti n Hiridusu nyai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 8:14" />Amwutuyi ɓəə kwu zamwi to ɓa ɓe n biledii shi m, akpəge knana gbmanyi n ɓa ɓə ncei shi dna n əya nuwnanya. <verse eid="MRK 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 8:15" />Yeisu wa kwnù ɓa, “Fye zhni pəceye, fye la əwye ka n Afarisiyi yisti n Hiridusu nyai.”<verse eid="MRK 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 8:16" />Ɓa da ɓəda n ajei əɓahniɓahni ɓa gna, “Ntuge yi to n biledii shi lo nu m.”<verse eid="MRK 8:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 8:17" />Woi kpe əɓo ye n ɓa da, wa nya ɓa əɓo, “Knyiyi nu zhni fyei daɓo nge fye to biledii shilo nu ma a? Fye too du fye gye əɓo əwye kwo fya ɓwa awyega m? Əfye abwugba n kwu kpakalá nu u? <verse eid="MRK 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 8:18" />Fye n awyei fyilo ama to fyei gyewyeba m, jesnu n atnubwai gyi ama to fyei wo ɓəda m? Fye ta pa lo m? <verse eid="MRK 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 8:19" />She mi ɓə sa aknana ngwnu-atnu ya ga aza adugwu-atnu, fye ɓə kwu awyiwoi acekwnu anunui ngwnu aknyiyi nu a?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 8:19">Ɓa dnaɓəgbe, “Ngwnu-awoceaba.”<verse eid="MRK 8:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 8:20" />“Jesnu she mi ɓə sa aknana ngwnu-tnaaba ya ga aza adugwu-anyi, fye ɓə kwu awyiwoi acekwnu anunui ngwnu aknyiyi nu a?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 8:20">Ɓa dnaɓəgbe, “Ngwnu-tnaaba.”<verse eid="MRK 8:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 8:21" />Wa gna ɓa, “Fye too du fye ɓwa awyega m?”<verse eid="MRK 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeisu ká wyebwayi gna n Betsaida</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 8:22" />Ɓa ɓe Betsaida, jesnu azaho ɓa ɓe Yeisu n wyebwayii ɓa ɓà wo nge wo to wo əɓwa. <verse eid="MRK 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 8:23" />Wa shi wyebwayi n əɓwa wa gbmiya gnyi n woi n əzhi gnagna. She wo ɓəə la aknyi knyikpe n əza yi awye jesnu wa kwu əwo aɓwa kpe n wo, Yeisu wa nya wo əɓo, “Ho gye nyaho lo?”<verse eid="MRK 8:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 8:24" />Wa kpe əwye wu wa gna, “Mi gye aza əwye lo; ɓa wulo ngye ashnuwna nu ɓai znazna laɓa.”<verse eid="MRK 8:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 8:25" />Njesnu Yeisu wa kpe əwo aɓwa n əza yi awye. Nsayi əwo awye ɓa kpeya, wa je wyebagye, wa gye nyahonyahoi n knaknaiya. <verse eid="MRK 8:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 8:26" />Yeisu wa tnu n woi n apyi, woi gna, “Kwo əzhi, to lo ho lodna m.”<verse eid="MRK 8:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Byitusu gbmiɓo ge Yeisu zhni Masifu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 8:27" />Yeisu n əwo amwutuyii ɓa lo azhi n ɓa shegwnu Kaisariya Fyilibyi. Ɓai lo n zokwo wa nya ɓa əɓo, “Aza gna nge mi zhni nyika nu a?”<verse eid="MRK 8:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 8:28" />Ɓa dnaɓəgbe, “Azaho gna Yohana Batizimazhniyi nu; azaje gna nge Iliya; dudulonu azaje nge, sheɓəgwognayi ho nu.”<verse eid="MRK 8:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 8:29" />Wa nyaɓo, “Ama əfye ma a? Fye gna ge mi zhni nyika nu a?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 8:29">Byitusu wa dnaɓəgbe, “Əho nu zhni Kirisiti.”<verse eid="MRK 8:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 8:30" />Yeisu wa kwnù ɓa nge ɓa to gna zahozahoyi ɓəye ntu əwo ɓo m.<verse eid="MRK 8:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeisu da əwohni əfyi ɓo n pmasnu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 8:31" />Nlonu wa ya ɓa nyawu nge ɓəshishinu Əza Nugwnu wa gyeazhnì aɓo bəgyé nya, jesnu abyeda, apirisiti atukwoda ɓədo n owa anyawuyii, ɓa ɓə la əwo aɓo na, jesnu ɓəshishinu a ɓə la wo wu, ama n anyipyei ngwnu-ata avnu woi laka n əfyi. <verse eid="MRK 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 8:32" />Wo ɓə da ɓəye pəipəi nu, jesnu Byitusu wa pmyi wo gnyi n gnagna wa ya gnaknyi wo.<verse eid="MRK 8:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 8:33" />Ama she Yeisu ɓə pmyi wa shi əwo amwutuyi awye, wa gnaknyi Byitusu. Wa gna, “Pmyiyagnyi n əmi avnu Shetam! Ho to n ɓənubwozhni Shekwoyi nyai dnalo n bwugba m, ama zanyikwoci azanga nya nu n ɓwasnu.”<verse eid="MRK 8:33" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Znudu zokwo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 8:34" />Nlonu wa yì deeji zhi n abagbmanyi n kwnusnu n əwo amwutuyii wa gna: “Zahozahoyi ń wo ncei pmalo waa zhni əmi mwutuyi, ɓəshishinu waa əwohni aɓəna, wa la əwo znudu jesnu wa vyi mi. <verse eid="MRK 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 8:35" />Ntuge əza n wo ncei pmalo wa gnyi əwohni wyewyeyi, wo ɓə ɓwu kwo nuwna, ama əza n wa ɓwu əwo wyewyeyi nuwna ntu əmi ɓo ɓədo n nabagyi manayii, wo ɓə gnyi kwo. <verse eid="MRK 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 8:36" />Kwo n apmai lo n wunanu, n əza ɓa ɓwa anyì vnyanya ama waa ɓwu əwo wyewyeyi nuwna a? <verse eid="MRK 8:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 8:37" />Kwo knyiyi nu n əza ɓa ga dna n doshna ntu əwo wyewyeyi ɓo a? <verse eid="MRK 8:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 8:38" />Ngye əza lo n əmi vnyinkwo wo wo lo, ɓədo n əmi aɓədagbmai dna n cala anagbáizhni nya ye n aleifyizhniyi, Əza Nugwnu ɓə wo wo vnyinkwo ce, shi wo ɓə ɓe dna n əwo Dada latu n kwnusnu n amaləka agyigyiyii.”<verse eid="MRK 8:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="MRK 9" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 9:1" />Nlonu wa gna ɓa, “Ɓəhnihni əmi nu gna fye, azaho gnyiagnyi zhilo ń ya n ɓa taa to əfyi wo m akpəge ɓa kwu gye Shekwoyi əbemi kwoi kashi ɓe dna n əkwo kalá.”<verse eid="MRK 9:1" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeisu bmaznuznu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 9:2" />N anyipyei tnanyi avnu, Yeisu wa kwu Byitusu ɓədo n Jemyis n Yohanai n kwnusnu n woi, wa gwnukpe lo n ɓai ń əpe asnada ɓahniɓahni. Tu n abaayi waa znubma dna ń zafnu n əɓa awyeba. <verse eid="MRK 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 9:3" />Əwo aje ɓa kwu zè n fnai palilii, n du nyahonyahoi ń fnafna ń a ɓa shni kwo zhnazhna dna n anyì. <verse eid="MRK 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 9:4" />Njesnu Iliya n Mwusai ɓa kpmiyazhi n əɓa awyeba, ɓai daɓo n Yeisui.<verse eid="MRK 9:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 9:5" />Byitusu wa gna Yeisu, “Rabyi, kwo bmyalo she yi kpəzhilo ń ya. Fa ya kpe alubwi ngwnu-ata; gbmanyi əho nya, gbmanyi Mwusa nya jesnu gbmanyi Iliya nya.” <verse eid="MRK 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 9:6" />(Wo to ɓə kpe əɓo əye n wo ɓa da m ntuge ɓa ɓə fyi zhi n ədna yaakwo nu).<verse eid="MRK 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 9:7" />Nlonu ənyì kwa gbmitu kwa kwu pwu ɓa, jesnu ɓa wo bəgye kwoi daɓo n ənyì, “Əmi Nugwnu nu nyi, əwo nu n mi ye. Fye kna wo tnubwa!”<verse eid="MRK 9:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 9:8" />N əsagbmanyii, she ɓa ɓə shiawye laɓa, to ɓa shna zahozahoyi wyegye n kwnugnyi n ɓai m, akpəge Yeisu.<verse eid="MRK 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 9:9" />Shi ɓa ɓə ɓe ɓai kazhi shnizhi ń əpe, Yeisu wa ga ɓa ɓəgbetu nge ɓa to gna zahozahoyi əɓo n ɓa kwu gyewye nyi m, sai əsa n a ɓə la Əza Nugwnu laka ń əfyi. <verse eid="MRK 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 9:10" />Ɓa kwu aɓo ye shi fyi əɓahni, ɓai nya aje əɓo n Yeisu da, “ɓə laka n əfyi.”<verse eid="MRK 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 9:11" />Nlonu ɓa nya wo əɓo, “Knyiyi nu zhni owa anyawuyi ɓai gna nge ɓəshishinu Iliya wa ɓe kpmisnu a?”<verse eid="MRK 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 9:12" />Yeisu wa dnaɓəgbe, “Ɓəhnihnii, Iliya ɓə la ɓe n kpmisnu, waa aɓo zhnizhi vnyanya. Knyiyi nu zhni kwo ncei kafyilo nge ɓəshishinu Əza Nugwnu woi gyeazhnì n mwa jesnu ai la əwo aɓo na a? <verse eid="MRK 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 9:13" />Ama əmi nu gna fye, Iliya ɓə la ɓe, jesnu ɓa kwu ɓəhoɓəhoi zhni kpe wo n ɓa ɓə ncei pma, n ɓwasnu shi kwo kafyilo ntu əwo ɓo.”<verse eid="MRK 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeisu ga əɓyinugbai n wo n zafnu ajegbmiyii kágna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 9:14" />She ɓa ɓə ɓe da amwutuyi aje, ɓa gye deeji yaakwo n zhi n shegwnu ɓa, jesnu owa anyawuyii zhi ɓai naɓo kpeaje n ɓai. <verse eid="MRK 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 9:15" />She aza vnyanya ɓə ze n Yeisu əwyegyegyei, ɓa kwu nu zhi n ɓəwowoi jesnu ɓa bwusi lo ɓai ɓyi wo əgna.<verse eid="MRK 9:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 9:16" />Wa nya ɓa əɓo, “Fye naɓo kpeaje n ɓai ntu knyiɓei nu a?”<verse eid="MRK 9:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 9:17" />Əza ɓə dna n deeji wa gna, “Nyawuyi, ma ɓe ho n əmi nugwnui nu ń wo n zafnu nukwoi dna kwoi kpma wo ɓəda. <verse eid="MRK 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 9:18" />Əsahosahoi n kwa la wo kala ncei, kwa shewoya shi n əknyi. Wa pwuafugya n əgbe, wa gyi əwo anyikna jesnu waa wo gagaga. Ma gna əho amwutuyi nge ɓa gbmi zafnui ya, ama to ɓa nyi myi m.”<verse eid="MRK 9:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 9:19" />Yeisu wa dnaɓəgbe, “Əfye cala tnagaiciyagai nya, mi ɓa kwnusnu n fyei əsa ngwnu aknyiyi nu a? Mi ɓa ɓwa bwugba n fyei əsa ngwnu aknyiyi nu a? Ɓe mi n əɓyinugbai yii.”<verse eid="MRK 9:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 9:20" />Ntulonu ɓa ɓe wo n woi, she zafnu nukwoi ɓə gye Yeisu əwye, n əsagbmanyii, kwa la əɓyinugbai kpəkpə nyasna kala. Wa myiya shi n əknyi wa pmyiya laɓa woi pwuafugya n əgbe.<verse eid="MRK 9:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 9:21" />Yeisu wa nya əɓyinugbai dada əɓo, “Ɓəye ɓə ya wo zhni n knyisai nu a?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 9:21">Wa dnaɓəgbe, “Woi ye zhni əɓyi nawyii. <verse eid="MRK 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 9:22" />Kwo zhni kwoi shewoya dna n əná kwo nuwna ciici nabai kwa wu wo. Ama ngye ho ɓa myi ha zhni ɓəho, gye yi snusnu jesnu ha bma yi zhni.”<verse eid="MRK 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 9:23" />Yeisu wa gna, “ ‘Ngye ho ɓa myi nu u’? Ɓəhoɓəhoi yezhni n əza aba n wo ga gaiciya.”<verse eid="MRK 9:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 9:24" />N əsagbmanyii əɓyinugbai yi dada wa gna, “Mi la gaiciyaga; bma mi zhni ma myi n əmi tnagaiciyaga əɓo!”<verse eid="MRK 9:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 9:25" />She Yeisu ɓə gye deeji kwoi bwusi ɓe abaayi, wa gnaknyi ase yi. Wa gna, “Əho ase tnubwagwuyi n takpeɓəda nyai, mi tu ho ɓəgbe, gbmiya n wo jesnu to ha je lodna n wo m, kpeekpe.”<verse eid="MRK 9:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 9:26" />Ase yi kwa fyiakwu, kwa la wo kpəkpə yaakwo kala jesnu kwa gbmiya. Əɓyinugbai yi ɓə shi ngye zafyi nu, aza bəgyé ɓa gna, “Wo la fyí.” <verse eid="MRK 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 9:27" />Ama Yeisu wa shi wo n əɓwa wa la wo kala gnyiagnyi, jesnu waa gnyiagnyi.<verse eid="MRK 9:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 9:28" />Əsa ń Yeisu ɓə la lodna n nyakwnumi, əwo amwutuyi ɓa nya wo əɓo fyaa, “Knyiyi nu naa zhni to ya myi n kwo gbmiya ma a?”<verse eid="MRK 9:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 9:29" />Wa dnaɓəgbe, “Dəye pya ɓa ɓwa gbmiya n aduwazhnii nu.”<verse eid="MRK 9:29" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeisu da əwo əfyi ɓo əɓwa baayi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 9:30" />Ɓa kwuka n abaayi jesnu ɓa duya n Gəlili. Yeisu to ɓə ncei pma zahozahoyi wa kpe aba əye n ɓa ɓə zhi m, <verse eid="MRK 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 9:31" />ntuge wo ɓə gnyi woi wu əwo amwutuyi ənya nu. Wa gna ɓa, “A ɓə la Əza Nugwnu ai la ga dna n aza akwnu. Ɓa ɓə la wo wu, jesnu n anyipyei ngwnu-ata avnu, wo ɓə laka.” <verse eid="MRK 9:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 9:32" />Ama to ɓa ɓwa awyega əɓo nya n wo ɓə zhninubwo ncei m, jesnu ədna kwoi wo ɓa n ɓa ɓá nya wo əɓo ntuce nyi.<verse eid="MRK 9:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 9:33" />Ɓa ɓe Kapanam. She wo ɓə loɓe pwuwa ncei, wa nya ɓa əɓo, “Fye ɓəə ɓe fyei naɓokpeaje n zokwo ntu knyiɓei nu a?” <verse eid="MRK 9:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 9:34" />Ama ɓa kwu cepyi ntuge ɓa ɓə ɓe n zokwo ɓai naɓokpeaje ntu əza ɓo n wo nu zhni duduyi.<verse eid="MRK 9:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 9:35" />She wo ɓə sasetu, wa yì Awoceaba zhi wa gna, “Əza n wo ncei pmalo waa zhni kpmisnui, ɓəshishinu əwo nu ɓaa zhni kpmaknai jesnu tnutnuzhniyi aza vnyanya nya.”<verse eid="MRK 9:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 9:36" />Wa la əɓyi nawyi wa wo dna n əɓa atasni. She wo ɓə la wo láshi, wa gna ɓa, <verse eid="MRK 9:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 9:37" />“Əzadəhodəhoyi n wa gwo əɓyi gbmanyi n aɓyi anawyii ye dna n əmi əye, wo la mi gwo; jesnu əzadəhodəhoyi n wa gwo əmi, wo to ɓwa əmi nu gwo m, ama wo la əmi Dada gwo n wo ɓə tnu n mii nyi!”<verse eid="MRK 9:37" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Zahozahoyi n wo ta gnyiapaapa n əyii m, wo zhni əyi nya nu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 9:38" />Yohana wa gna, “Nyawuyi, yi ɓə kwu gye əzaho woi kwnu ase ya dna n əho əye, jesnu ya gna wo nge wo la fa ntuge wo to dnalo n əyi okwu m.”<verse eid="MRK 9:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 9:39" />Yeisu wa gna, “Fye to kpma wo m. Ntuge zahozahoyi to lo n wo zhni ɓəwowoi dna n əmi əye, n wo ɓa pmyiavnu əsa fyewyi wa da ɓənukwoi tu n əmi tukwo m, <verse eid="MRK 9:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 9:40" />ntuge zahozahoyi n wo ta gnyiapaapa lo n əyii m, wo zhni əyi nya nu. <verse eid="MRK 9:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 9:41" />Ɓəhnihni əmi nu gna fye, zahozahoyi n wo ga fye nuwna dna n əmi əye ntuge fye zhni Kirisiti anya nu, to n kpmakpmai m, wo to ɓə ɓwu əwo gyiba nuwna m.<verse eid="MRK 9:41" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ənya n kwo ɓe n bwonyicei</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 9:42" />“Ndei zahozahoyi wa zhni zaknayi ń aɓyi anawyi ye n ɓa n gaiciyai ga n mi nyi, wa cebwonyi, kwo ɓəi ɓa wo du aa wyigwokwuta dnagbmai gyidna wo ń bəgye jesnu aa wo sheya dna n shikwo. <verse eid="MRK 9:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 9:43" />Ngye əho əɓwa ɓa zhni ho ha cebwonyi, la kwo znuya. Kwo n hoi dulo hoi lodna ń wyewyeyi n əɓwai gbmanyi, a fa ədo n ho ɓə lodna ń anápyi n aɓwai ngwnu-aba nyi, aba n əná ta wnu m. [<verse eid="MRK 9:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 9:44" />‘Aba ń əɓa vnyinukwnu ta fyí m, jesnu əná ta wnu m.’] <verse eid="MRK 9:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 9:45" />Jesnu ngye əho pita ɓa zhni ho ha cebwonyi, la kwo znuya. Kwo n hoi dulo hoi lodna ń wyewyeyi n pitai gbmanyi, a fa ədo n a ɓə she ho ya dna ń anápyi n apitai ngwnu-aba. [<verse eid="MRK 9:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 9:46" />‘Aba ń əɓa vnyinukwnu ta fyi m, jesnu əná ta wnu m.’] <verse eid="MRK 9:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 9:47" />Jesnu ngye əho əwyekwnunu ɓa zhni ho ha cebwonyi, la kwo gbmiya. Kwo n hoi dulo hoi lodna ń Shekwoyi əbemi n əwyei gbmanyi, a fa ədo ń a ɓə she ho ya dna ń anápyi n awyekwnunui fyi ngwnu-aba nyi, <verse eid="MRK 9:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 9:48" />‘Aba ń əɓa avnyinukwnu ta fyi m, jesnu əná ta wnu m.’<verse eid="MRK 9:48" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 9:49" />A ɓə mwu zahozahoyi n ənái nu.<verse eid="MRK 9:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 9:50" />“Snakpegye n bmya, ama ń əkwo apmanya nla kwnuya, a ɓa zhni kwo n wunanu kwa je əkwo apmanya ɓwa a? Fye kwu snakpegye ɓwa fyi n əfyehni jesnu fya kwu zhi n bwugbafui n ajei.”<verse eid="MRK 9:50" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="MRK 10" />
  <para style="s1">Mwulawu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 10:1" />Nlonu Yeisu wa fa abaayi wa lo Yahudiya əknyi n Urudu əkpma dəyi. Njesnu deeji ɓa ɓe da wo, jesnu shi əwo kwnunu ɓə nyi, wa wu ɓa ənya.<verse eid="MRK 10:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 10:2" />Afarisiyi ho ɓa ɓe, ɓa mwu wo, ɓa nya wo əɓo, “Owa ncei ye lo nge əza wo wu mwula n əwo nyikwoi?”<verse eid="MRK 10:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 10:3" />Wa dnaɓəgbe, “Mwusa ɓə tu fye əgbe nge nanu a?”<verse eid="MRK 10:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 10:4" />Ɓa gna, “Mwusa ɓə la ye nge zanugbayi wo ka nyakaɓəgbmi mwulawu nya ga əwo nyikwo jesnu wa wo nya ya.”<verse eid="MRK 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 10:5" />Yeisu wa dnaɓəgbe, “Ntu əfye adu akalákpe ɓo nu, cenu ɓə zhni Mwusa wa ka owa ye ga fye. <verse eid="MRK 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 10:6" />Ama n aɓoyayaba, Shekwoyi, ‘ɓə zhni ɓa zanugbai n nyikwozai nu.’ <verse eid="MRK 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 10:7" />Ntu dəye ɓo, zanugbayi ɓa fa əwo dada n əwo əyai jesnu wa nyima əwo nyikwo, <verse eid="MRK 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 10:8" />jesnu əɓa ngwnu-aba ɓa ɓə kwu zè nayi gbmanyi, ntulonu ɓa to ye zhni ngwnu-aba nu m, ama nayi gbmanyi. <verse eid="MRK 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 10:9" />Ntucenu ənya ń Shekwoyi n la cigyido, zahozahoyi to gna kwo ajeya m.”<verse eid="MRK 10:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 10:10" />She ɓa ɓə kwu lofyi n apyi njesnu, amwutuyi ɓa nya Yeisu əɓo ntu ɓəye ɓo. <verse eid="MRK 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 10:11" />Wa dnaɓəgbe, “Zahozahoyi ń wa kwu mwulawu n əwo nyikwoi waa la nyikwo ədo, wo zhni anagbái nu n woi. <verse eid="MRK 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 10:12" />Njesnu nyikwoza n wa kwu mwulawu n əwo əɓai waa so ənu ədo, wo zhni anagbái nu n woi.”<verse eid="MRK 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Aɓyi anawyii n Yeisui</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 10:13" />Aza ɓə zhi ɓai ɓe Yeisu n aɓyii nabai wa kpe ɓa əwo aɓwa, ama amwutuyi ɓa gnaknyi ɓa. <verse eid="MRK 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 10:14" />She Yeisu ɓə gye dəye, to ca da wo m. Wa gna ɓa, “Fye fa aɓyi anawyi ɓa ɓe da mi, fye to nya ɓa ya m, ntuge Shekwoyi əbemi zhni əɓa pya nya nu. <verse eid="MRK 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 10:15" />Ɓəhnihni mi nu gna fye, zahozahoyi n wo taa gwo Shekwoyi əbemi ngye əɓyi nawyii m, wo to ɓə lodna ń kwo m, nanyinanyi.” <verse eid="MRK 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 10:16" />Nlonu waa aɓyi anawyii kwu shi, wa kpe ɓa əwo aɓwa jesnu wa tu ɓa anabəlika.<verse eid="MRK 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nyaɓwayi dna n Shekwoyi əbemii</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 10:17" />Shi Yeisu ɓə laka lo n əznai, əzaho wa bwusi lo da wo jesnu wa ceakwokwo shi n əwo abye. Wa nyaɓo, “Nyawuyi manai, knyi ɓəshishii nu n mi ɓa zhni nabai mii ɓwa wyewyeyi nyalonyalo nya a?”<verse eid="MRK 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 10:18" />Yeisu wa dnaɓəgbe, “Knyiyi nu zhni hoi yi mi nge əza manai a? Əza manai to lo m; akpəge Shekwoyi gbmanyi. <verse eid="MRK 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 10:19" />Ho kpe aɓəgbetu əye lo: ‘Ho taa wu əza m, ho taa zhni anagbái m, ho taa wyivyi m, ho taa gbmi əɓo katá nya m, ho taa gyi əza fyi m, ga əho dada mwamwa n əho əyai.’ ”<verse eid="MRK 10:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 10:20" />Wa gna, “Nyawuyi, əɓa vnyanya mi ɓə ya ɓa ɓwashi mii ye zhni əɓyi nawyii nu.”<verse eid="MRK 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 10:21" />Yeisu wa shi wo awye jesnu wa wu wo yeye. Wa gna wo, “Ənya gbmanyi n kwo n hoi ce, lo ho kwnu nyahonyahoi n ho ncei lo, jesnu ha kwu ga awyekwoyi, ho ɓə ɓwa nyaɓwayezhi n əshemi. Nlonu, hoi ɓe ha vyi mi.”<verse eid="MRK 10:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 10:22" />She nyaɓwayi ɓə wo dəye, əwo awyeba ɓaa wnudna. Wa laka lo n bwugbawnui, ntuge wo ɓəi n nyaɓwai n mwa kwokwo.<verse eid="MRK 10:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 10:23" />Yeisu wa shiawye ɓa n shegwnu, wa gna əwo amwutuyi, “Kwo dnaɓo lo gyiwyeda woi lodna n Shekwoyi əbemi!”<verse eid="MRK 10:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 10:24" />Əwo amwutuyi ɓa kwu zhi n ɓəwowoi ntu əwo aɓəda aɓo. Ama Yeisu wa je gna, “Aɓyi, gye kwo dnaɓo lo əza n wo ye gyiwye, woi lodna n Shekwoyi əbemi! <verse eid="MRK 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 10:25" />Kwo gna wo lo faafa lakwnumi kwa du n acibwa, a fa əza n wo n nyaɓwai lo woi lodna n Shekwoyi əbemi.”<verse eid="MRK 10:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 10:26" />Ca gna amwutuyi wowo, jesnu ɓa gna aje, “To, nyika nu ɓə pwo a?”<verse eid="MRK 10:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 10:27" />Yeisu wa shi ɓa awye wa gna, “N zanyikwoci aba dəye taa yezhni m, ama toge n Shekwoyii m; ntuge aɓo vnyanya yezhni n Shekwoyii.”<verse eid="MRK 10:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 10:28" />Nlonu Byitusu wa daɓo, “Yi kwu nyahonyahoi fa nabai ya vyi ho!”<verse eid="MRK 10:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 10:29" />Yeisu wa dnaɓəgbe, “Ɓəhnihni, əmi nu gna fye, əzaho to lo n wo la əwo pwuwa fa, kwo əwo azaje kwo amapwii, kwo əya, kwo əda kwo aɓyi kwo afwa ntu əmi ɓo n nabagyi manaii, <verse eid="MRK 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 10:30" />n wo to ɓə gwo gyiba aɓwa tagyi dna n anyì ye: (apwuwa, azaje, amapwii, àya, aɓyi ɓədo n afwai; jesnu n kwnusnu n wyenashei) dna n anyì dəyi n ɓa ɓə ɓe nyi, wyewyeyi nyalonyalo nya m. <verse eid="MRK 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 10:31" />Ama bəgyé n ɓa nu zhni akpmisnuyi ɓa ɓə kwu zè akpmaknayi, jesnu akpmaknayi ɓa ɓə kwu zè akpmisnuyi.”<verse eid="MRK 10:31" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeisu da əwo əfyi ɓo əɓwa taayi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 10:32" />Ɓa ɓə zhi ɓai gwnulo Urishelima nu, Yeisu woi gyiabye lo n zokwo, jesnu ca wo əwo amwutuyi, ama aza yi n ɓa ɓə vyi wo nyi, ədna kwa wo ɓa. Njesnu wa pmyi Awoceaba zhi n gnagna, wa gna ɓa əɓo n kwo ɓə ɓwa wo. <verse eid="MRK 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 10:33" />Wa gna, “Yi gwnulo Urishelima nu, jesnu a ɓə la Əza Nugwnu taya ga apirisiti tukwoda n owa anyawuyii. Ɓa ɓə la əfyi owa znutu wo jesnu ɓai la wo taya dna n Abyedo akwnu, <verse eid="MRK 10:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 10:34" />aza n ɓa ɓə kpe wo agyè jesnu ɓai knyiaknyi kpe wo, ɓai la wo ɓyeya ń knalufnyii jesnu ɓai la wo wu. N anyipyei ata avnu, wo ɓə laka.”<verse eid="MRK 10:34" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Wyegyi Jemyis nya n Yohanai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 10:35" />Nlonu Jemyis n Yohanai, Zebədi anugwnu, ɓa ɓe da wo, ɓa gna, “Nyawuyi, yi ncei pma ha zhni ɓəhoɓəhoi n ya nya ho.”<verse eid="MRK 10:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 10:36" />Wa nyaɓo, “Fye ncei pma ma zhni knyiɓei nu ga fye a?”<verse eid="MRK 10:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 10:37" />Ɓa dnaɓəgbe, “Fa zaknayi n yi woi sasetu ntu ɓwaizhe jesnu əzabaayi n əho ɓwapmi dna n əho latu.”<verse eid="MRK 10:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 10:38" />Yeisu wa gna, “Fye ta kpe ənya əye lo ń fye nya əkwo əɓo nyi m. Fye ɓa myi fya sni bwoɓyi ń mi ye ma sni nyi, kwo a zhni fye batizima n a kwu zhni mi nyi?”<verse eid="MRK 10:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 10:39" />Ɓa dnaɓəgbe, “Yi ɓa myi.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 10:39">Yeisu wa gna ɓa, “Fye ɓa myi fya sni bwoɓyi n mi ye ma sni nyi jesnu a ɓa zhni fye batizima n batizimai n a gnyi ai zhni mi nyi, <verse eid="MRK 10:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 10:40" />ama fyei sase kpe ń əmi ɓwaizhe kwo ń əmi ɓwaipmi, əmi nya nu to ma ga fye m. Aba ye zhni aza yi nya nu ń a ɓə zhni ɓa ntu əɓa ɓo nu nyi.”<verse eid="MRK 10:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 10:41" />She ngwnu-awo ɓə wo dəye, ɓa kwu gyi minagyi n Jemyis ɓədo n Yohanai. <verse eid="MRK 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 10:42" />Yeisu wa yì ɓa zhi n abagbmanyi wa gna, “Fye kpəlo nge aza yi n a yi ɓa nge abegyiyi Abyedo nya nyi, ɓa wna ɓa əsnu, jesnu əɓa atukwoda ayaakwo zhni ɓa wu ɓa ikwo. <verse eid="MRK 10:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 10:43" />Kwo taa zè nlonu n əfye aba m. N əkwo apita, əzahozahoyi n wo ye waa zè əza yaakwo n əfye atasni, ɓəshishi nu waa zè əfye tnutnuyi, <verse eid="MRK 10:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 10:44" />jesnu əza n wo ncei pmalo waa zè kpmisnuyi, ɓəshishi nu waa zè fyenu əfye vnyanya nya. <verse eid="MRK 10:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 10:45" />Ntuge kwo Əza Nugwnu to ɓə ɓe nabai a zhni wo tnutnu nu nyi m, ama wa zhni aza tnutnu, jesnu wa ga əwo wyewyeyi kwaa zè tagbanya ntu bəgyé ɓo.”<verse eid="MRK 10:45" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Wyebwayi Batimawus gwo əwo wyebagye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 10:46" />Nlonu ɓa ɓe Jerikwo. Əsa n Yeisu n əwo amwutuyii, n kwnusnu n deeji yaakwoi, ɓəə zhi ɓai fá əzhiyaakwo, wyebwayi, Batimawus (n kwo nu gyi, “Timawus nugwnu nyi”), ɓə sasetu n zokwogbe woi ɓanya. <verse eid="MRK 10:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 10:47" />She wo ɓə wo nge Yeisu Nazeretiyi nu lo, wa ya wyiɓe, “Yeisu, Dawuda Nugwnu, gye mi snusnu!”<verse eid="MRK 10:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 10:48" />Bəgyé kwa gnaknyi wo jesnu ɓa gna wo nge wo la cepyi, ama wa gna əwyi ɓeɓe, “Dawuda Nugwnu, gye mi snusnu!”<verse eid="MRK 10:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 10:49" />Yeisu wa kpegnyi wa gna, “Fye yì wo ɓə ncei.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 10:49">Ntulonu ɓa yi wyebwayi, “Nya agbmada! Laka gnyiagnyi! Wo yi ho lo.” <verse eid="MRK 10:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 10:50" />Wa she əwo gbodo ya zhi n gnagna, wa laka gnyiagnyi n pyepyei, wa ɓe da Yeisu.<verse eid="MRK 10:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="MRK 10:51" />Yeisu wa nya wo, “Ho ye ma zhni knyiɓei nu ga ho a?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 10:51">Wyebwayi wa gna, “Nyawuyi, mi ye ma gyewyeba.”<verse eid="MRK 10:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="MRK 10:52" />Yeisu wa gna, “Lo, əho gaiciyaganunui n la ho kágna.” Nsayisayii wa gwo əwo wyebagye jesnu wa vyi Yeisu lo n zokwoi.<verse eid="MRK 10:52" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="MRK 11" />
  <para style="s1">Yeisu lo ɓe Urishelima n zhni Əsu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 11:1" />Shi ɓa ɓə wo vyivyiwyi n Urishelimai, ɓa ɓe Betifyeji ń Byetanii kpe ń Zaitu Əpe, Yeisu wa tnu əwo amwutuyi ngwnu-aba tnutnu, <verse eid="MRK 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 11:2" />woi gna ɓa, “Fye lo əzhi n kwo zhi ń əfye abye nyi, shi fye ɓwa lofyi n kwo, fye ɓə gye zhagawyi snáyi ədo ń əzaho too shni kwo gwnu m, n gyignyi n ɓo. Fye lo kwo fya ɓe n kwoi ń ya. <verse eid="MRK 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 11:3" />Ń əzaho wa nya fye əɓo, ‘Knyiyi nu zhni fyei zhni ɓəye a?’ Fye gna, ‘Dagayi n əkwo apmai lo jesnu əsa fyewyi, wo ɓa je tnu n kwoi n ya.’ ”<verse eid="MRK 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 11:4" />Ɓa lo ɓa gye zhagawyi snáyi n tu n dnadna n gyignyi n abwokwnumi əgbe. She ɓa ɓə zhi ɓai lo kwo, <verse eid="MRK 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 11:5" />azaho n ɓa ɓə zhi n abaayi, ɓa nyaɓo, “Fye zhni knyiyi nu fyei lo zhagawyi snáyi ye a?” <verse eid="MRK 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 11:6" />Ɓa dnaɓəgbe she Yeisu ɓə gna ɓa nyi, jesnu aza ɓa fa ɓá ɓa lo kwo. <verse eid="MRK 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 11:7" />She ɓa ɓə ɓe Yeisu n zhagawyii, ɓa kwu əɓa aje takpe n kwo, wa sasetu n kwo. <verse eid="MRK 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 11:8" />Aza bəgyé ɓa ta əɓa aje zhi lo n zokwoi, azaje cè ɓai bma abalá ɓə ncei n bmana ɓai ya zhi n zokwo. <verse eid="MRK 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 11:9" />Aza n ɓa ɓə gyiabye nyi, ɓədo n azai n ɓa ɓə vyi ɓá nyi, ɓa ɓəwyi ɓai gna,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 11:9">“Hosana!”</para>
  <para style="b" vid="MRK 11:9" />
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 11:9">“Anabəlikada nu n əzai n wo ɓe dna n Dagayi əye!”<verse eid="MRK 11:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 11:10" />“Əyi dada Dawuda əbemi n kwo ɓe nyi kwo zhni anabəlika nya nu!”</para>
  <para style="b" vid="MRK 11:10" />
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 11:10">“Hosana duduyi dna n əshemi!”<verse eid="MRK 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 11:11" />Yeisu wa lodna n Urishelima wa lo Dagayipwuwa ashilagyí. Wa shi aɓo awye laɓa n shegwnu, kwo shikwonyi wyeshe ɓə la lu she, wa gbmiya lo Byetani n kwnusnu n Awoceabai.<verse eid="MRK 11:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeisu tu gbaayi shnuwna əknyí</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 11:12" />Əfye kwa gyi, shi ɓa ɓə zhi ɓai fa Byetani, myikwnu ɓə la Yeisu gwnu. <verse eid="MRK 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 11:13" />Shi wo ɓə gye gbaayi shnuwna ń tagnyi n afnyitoloi cikpe, wa lo wo kpe ngye kwo n gyigyii hoi tu lo. Əsa n wo ɓə si əkwo aba, to wa gye nyaho gyitu m, akpəge afnyitolo, ntuge gbaayi gyigyi əsa nu to ɓə gnyi m. <verse eid="MRK 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 11:14" />Nsayi wa gna shnuwna yi, “Kwo la zè ge zahozahoyi taa je əho gyigyiyi gyi m kpeekpe.” Əwo amwutuyi ɓa kwu wo woi da ce.<verse eid="MRK 11:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 11:15" />Shi Yeisu ɓə si Urishelima, wa lodna n Dagayipwuwa ashilagyí jesnu wa ya aza yi nyaya ń ɓa ɓə fyi ɓai si jesnu ɓai kwnú anya n ɓo nyi. Wa knyi agyiwye shnayí atebwul kwnú ɓədo n asasekpeba alukpe kwnuyi nyai, <verse eid="MRK 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 11:16" />jesnu to wa ye zahozahoyi nge wo gnyi gnyikwo dna n Dagayipwuwa ashilagyí m. <verse eid="MRK 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 11:17" />Shi wo ɓə gnyi woi wunya, wa gna, “A to ncei kafyilo, ‘A ɓa yi əmi pwuwa ge aduwazhni pwuwa nu abye vnyanya nya m’? Ama fye la kwo zè ‘avyì nyakwnu.’ ”<verse eid="MRK 11:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 11:18" />Shi Apirisiti tukwoda ɓədo n owa anyawuyi ɓə wo ɓəye, ɓa ya zokwo znashni she ɓa ɓá wu wo, ntuge ɓa ɓə wo əwo ədna, jesnu bəgyé vnyanya ɓə zhi n ɓəwowoi nu əwo nyawu nya.<verse eid="MRK 11:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 11:19" />She wyeshe ɓə she, Yeisu n əwo amwutuyii ɓa kwnuya n əzhiyaakwo.<verse eid="MRK 11:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 11:20" />N laabmii, she ɓa ɓə kwnuya lo, ɓa gye gbaayi shnuwna yi n ɓwáɓwai dù n əkwo agbegyei. <verse eid="MRK 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 11:21" />Byitusu wa pá wa gna Yeisu, “Rabyi, shiawye! Gbaayi n ho tui kwo əknyi nyi, kwo kwu ɓwaa!”<verse eid="MRK 11:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 11:22" />Yeisu wa dnaɓəgbe, “Fye kwu gaiciyaganunui ga n Shekwoyi. <verse eid="MRK 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 11:23" />Ɓəhnihni mi gna fye, ndei zahozahoyi wa gna əpe ye, ‘Lo, ho she əhohni ya dna n shikwo’ jesnu to wa fyi abwugba ngwnu-aba n əwo ədu m, ama waa gaiciyaga ge əɓo n wo da nyi, kwo ɓa kwu zhni, a ɓa kwu kwo zhni ga wo. <verse eid="MRK 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 11:24" />Ntucenu mi gna fye, nyahonyahoi n fya nya kwo ɓo dna n aduwazhni, fye kwu gaiciyaga ge fye la kwo ɓwa jesnu kwo ɓaa zè əfye nya. <verse eid="MRK 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 11:25" />Njesnu əsa n fye zhniaduwa, ngye fye n ɓəhoi dnalo n əmì n zahozahoyii, fye zo ɓa abwi, nabai əfye Dada n wo dna n əshemi nyi, n wo ɓa zo əfyehni aleifyi.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 11:25">[<verse eid="MRK 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 11:26" />Ama n fye to zo abwi m, əfye Dada n wo dna n əshemi nyi wo taa zo əfyehni aleifyi m.]<verse eid="MRK 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">A nya Yeisu aba n wo ɓwa əwo ikwo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 11:27" />Ɓa je lofyi n Urishelima, jesnu shi Yeisu ɓəə lo woi znazna dna n Dagayipwuwa ashilagyí, apirisiti atukwoda, owa anyawuyi ɓədo n abyedai ɓa ɓe da wo. <verse eid="MRK 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 11:28" />Ɓa nyaɓo, “N knyi ikwoi nu n ho zhni aɓo ye a? Jesnu nyika nu na ga ho ikwo nge ho zhni əɓo ye a?”<verse eid="MRK 11:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 11:29" />Yeisu wa dnaɓəgbe, “Mi ɓa nya fye əɓo gbmanyi. N fya dna mi ɓəgbe, mi ɓa wu fye ikwo ń mi zhni apma ncei mii zhni aɓo ye. <verse eid="MRK 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 11:30" />Yohana batizimazhnizhni: kwo ɓə gbmi n əshemi nu kwo əkwo ɓo ɓə pá n zanyikwoci nu a? Fye gna mi!”<verse eid="MRK 11:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 11:31" />Ɓa da kwo fyiaje ɓahniɓahni ɓa gna, “N ya gna, ‘N əshemi nu,’ wo ɓa nyaɓo, ‘To knyiyi nu zhni to fyehni ga wo gaiciya ma a?’ <verse eid="MRK 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 11:32" />Ama ń ya gna, ‘N zanyikwoci nu, aza taa fa yi m.’ ” (Ɓa ɓə wó aza ədna, ntuge zahozahoyi ɓə n gaiciyai ga nge Yohana ɓə zhni sheɓəgwognayi nu.)<verse eid="MRK 11:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 11:33" />Ntulonu ɓa dna Yeisu ɓəgbe, “Yi ta kpəlo m.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 11:33">Yeisu wa gna, “Əmihni ce mi taa gna fye n knyi ikwoi nu n mi zhni aɓo ye ncei m.”<verse eid="MRK 11:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="MRK 12" />
  <para style="s1">Ɓəsisi afwaɓayi nya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 12:1" />Nlonu Yeisu wa ya woi daɓo n ɓai n aɓəsisii: “Əza ɓə n anamzhnii dna. Wa mi gəlu n shegwnu kwo. Waa anamnuwnapyiba nyì dna ń kwo, jesnu waa abagwuyi nyakwnu asnada mi. Nlonu waa kwo ga afwaɓayi ho ɓa ɓá, wa laka wa lo abado. <verse eid="MRK 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 12:2" />N afwanyakwu əsai, wa tnu əwo tnutnuyi ń afwaɓayi aba nabai ɓa ga wo anam agyigyiyi ho ofwa yí nya. <verse eid="MRK 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 12:3" />Ama ɓa wna wo, ɓa lu wo jesnu ɓa wo jezeya lo n aɓwa gbəloi. <verse eid="MRK 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 12:4" />Nlonu wa tnu ɓa n tnutnuyi ədohoi; ɓa znu əza ye ənya n tukwo jesnu ɓa zhni wo avnyinkwo ɓo. <verse eid="MRK 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 12:5" />Wa du wa je tnu n əzadoi, ama əza yi da ɓaa wo wu. Wo ɓə kwu tnu n azajei n mwa bəgyé; azaho n ɓa, ɓa lu ɓa; ɓa kwu azaje wu.<verse eid="MRK 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 12:6" />“Wo ɓə n əzai kpma cegnyi wá tnu ncei, əwo nugwnu, n wo ye wo dəidəi. Wo ɓə kpma tnu n woi nu, woi gna, ‘Ɓa ɓá ga əmi nugwnu mwamwa.’<verse eid="MRK 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 12:7" />“Ama afwaɓayi ɓa gna aje, ‘Əza ye nu zhni əgwúgyiyi. Fye ɓe, ya wu wo, jesnu əgwú ɓə la zè əyi nya.’ <verse eid="MRK 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 12:8" />Ntulonu ɓa la wo, ɓaa wo wu, jesnu ɓaa wo sheyashi n anamzhni əbmyi.<verse eid="MRK 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 12:9" />“To knyiɓei nu n anamzhni da ɓə zhni a? Wo ɓə ɓe woi wu afwaɓayi, jesnu woi la anamzhni woi la ga azaje. <verse eid="MRK 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 12:10" />Fye too ba aba ye n nyakagyigyiyi ge;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 12:10">“ ‘Kwuta ń anyakwnumiyi ɓə la əkwo aɓo na nyi, əkwo nu n la zè ɓwakwonu kwuta;<verse eid="MRK 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 12:11" />Dagayi nu n kwu dəye zhni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 12:11">jesnu kwo to zhni əɓo wowoi nu n əyi awye m’?”<verse eid="MRK 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 12:12" />Nlonu apirisiti atukwoda, owa anyawuyii ɓədo n abyedai ɓa zna zokwo shni nabai ɓa wna wo, ntuge ɓa ɓə kwu kpe nge a da ɓəsisi ye tu n əɓa tukwo nu. Ama ɓa kwu wo deeji ədna; ntulonu ɓa fa wo jesnu ɓa kwukala n ɓo.<verse eid="MRK 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Gədu kwnu ga Kaisa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 12:13" />N dəye avnu ɓa tnu n Afarisiyi hoi ɓədo n Ahirudiyii lo Yeisu aba nabai ɓəə wna wo dna n əwo aɓədagbma. <verse eid="MRK 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 12:14" />Ɓa ɓe da wo ɓa gna, “Nyawuyi, yi kpəlo nge ho zhni əza gaiciyazhniyi nu. Aza ta myilo n ɓa pmyi ho awye m, ntuge ho ta shi əza awye lo kwo ɓa zhni anyika nu m; ama ho wu Shekwoyi zokwo ń kwo lodo n gaiciyanunui. Kwo wulo ceewo a gba Kaisa begyi gədu kwo a to gba ma a? <verse eid="MRK 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 12:15" />Yi gbaa, kwo yi to gba ma a?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 12:15">Ama Yeisu ɓə kpe əɓa kwocedna əɓo ye. Wa nyaɓo, “Knyiyi nu zhni fyei ye fya pyi mi agbúlu a? Fye ɓe mi n denarii n ya ma shi kwo awye.” <verse eid="MRK 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 12:16" />Ɓa ɓe wo n gyiwye zhnanai, jesnu wa nya ɓa əɓo, “Nyika dogbe nu tu nyi a? Jesnu nyika əye nu kwnukpe n kwo a?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 12:16">Ɓa dnaɓəgbe, “Kaisa nya nu.”<verse eid="MRK 12:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 12:17" />Nlonu Yeisu wa gna ɓa, “Fye ga Kaisa ənya n kwo zhni Kaisa nya, Shekwoyi, ənya n kwo zhni Shekwoyi ənya.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 12:17">Əwo əɓo kwa wo ɓa.<verse eid="MRK 12:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Amwula pa fyi n əfyikalakwu əsa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 12:18" />Nlonu Asadusiyi; aza n ɓa gna nge əfyikalakwu to lo nyi m, ɓa ɓe da wo n ɓənyai shi. <verse eid="MRK 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 12:19" />Ɓa gna, “Nyawuyi, Mwusa ɓə kwu ka ga yi nge, n əza dnagbma wa fyí jesnu wa fa əwo nyikwo gnyi ntna aɓyi, ɓəshishi nu əza yi wa la nyigbayi jesnu wa ɓwa əɓyi ga əwo dnagbma. <verse eid="MRK 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 12:20" />Nsayii aza ɓə nyi ngwnu-tnaaba ɓai kwnu n əyàmi gbmanyi. Əza kpmisnuyi wa la nyikwo jesnu waa fyí to woi ɓwa əɓyi m. <verse eid="MRK 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 12:21" />Əzabaayi wa la nyigbayi, əwohni ce waa fyí to woi ɓwa əɓyi m. Əza taayi kwa ɓwa jezhni nlonu. <verse eid="MRK 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 12:22" />Ɓəhnihni, əzaho to lo n ɓa ngwnu-tnaaba yi n wo ɓə ɓwa əɓyi m. N kpmasnu nyikwo yi ce, waa fyíi. <verse eid="MRK 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 12:23" />N əfyikalakwu əsa, wo ɓə zhni nyika nyikwo nu a, shikwonyi əɓa ngwnu-tnaaba ɓa ɓə kwu mwulapa n woi nyi a?”<verse eid="MRK 12:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 12:24" />Yeisu wa dnaɓəgbe, “Fye fyilo n abaɓwi ntuge fye ta kpe Anyakagyigyiyi ye lo, kwo Shekwoyi kalá m. <verse eid="MRK 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 12:25" />She afyífyiyi ɓə kwukala, ɓa to ɓə pa amwula, kwo ai ga ɓa fyi n amwula m; ɓa ɓə kwu wu ngye amaləka nu fyi ń əshemi. <verse eid="MRK 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 12:26" />Nsaiye ntu afyífyiyi kalakwu ɓo; fye too ba n Pafyi n kwo kafyi n Mwusa nya, dna n abwugizhi ənagyi, she Shekwoyi ɓə gna wo, ‘Əmi nu zhni Shekwoyi Ibrahim nya, Shekwoyi Ishakwu nya, jesnu əmi nu zhni Shekwoyi Yakwuɓwu nya m?’ <verse eid="MRK 12:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 12:27" />Wo to zhni Shekwoyi afyífyiyi nya nu m, ama aza awyewyeyi nya. Fye kwu ɓwuaba n mwa!”<verse eid="MRK 12:27" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɓəgbetu duduyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 12:28" />Zaknayi ń owa anyawuyi wa ɓe wa wo ɓa zhi ɓai naɓokpeaje. She wo ɓə gye Yeisu wo la əɓo dnagbe ceewo, wa nya əwo əɓo, “N aɓəgbetu n ɓa lo vnyanya nyi, knyidei nu dulo n apma a?”<verse eid="MRK 12:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 12:29" />Yeisu wa dnaɓəgbe, “Ədo n kwo dulo nu nyi: ‘Knatnubwa, O Israila: Dagayi əyi Shekwoyi, Dagayi woo lo gbmanyi nu. <verse eid="MRK 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 12:30" />Ye Dagayi əho Shekwoyi n əho ədui vnyanya n əho wyewyeyii vnyanya n əho bwugbai vnyanya ɓədo n əho akalái vnyanya.’ <verse eid="MRK 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 12:31" />Baayi nu nyi: ‘Ye əho kwnuzhiyi ngye əhohni.’ Ɓəgbetu ədo to lo n kwo du adəye m.”<verse eid="MRK 12:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 12:32" />Əza yi wa dnaɓəgbe, “Ho kwu da n bmya, nyawuyi. Ho dnalo n zokwo she ha gna nge, Shekwoyi gbmanyi nu nyi, jesnu nge əzado to shnasnu lo m akpəge əwo. <verse eid="MRK 12:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 12:33" />N ha ye wo n əho ədui vnyanya, n əho gənyikpei vnyanya, n əho akalái vnyanya, jesnu ha ye əho kwnuzhiyi ngye shi ho ye əhohni nyi, kwo dulo n apma a fa anyaga anakpei vnyanya ɓədo n anyakwnukwnui.”<verse eid="MRK 12:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 12:34" />She Yeisu ɓə gye nge wo la əɓo dnaɓəgbe n wyemwai, wa gna wo, “Ho to mwakpa lo n Shekwoyi əbemii m.” Jesnu ənya n kwo laka nsayii kwoi lo n abyei, əzaho to ɓə shna wo ɓəho nya m.<verse eid="MRK 12:34" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nyika nugwnu nu n Masifu a?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 12:35" />Yeisu wo ye gnyi woi wunya dna n Dagayipwuwa ashilagyí, wa nyaɓo, “Kwo zè n wunanu owa anyawuyi ɓai gna nge Kirisiti zhni Dawuda nugwnu nu a? <verse eid="MRK 12:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 12:36" />Dawuda n əwohni tukwoi, n wo ɓə daɓo dna n Zafnu Gyigyiyi, wo ɓə da:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 12:36">“ ‘Dagayi ɓə gna əmi Dagayi:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 12:36">“La sasetu n əmi ɓwaizhe</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 12:36">nya əsa ń mi ɓə kwu əho anuwnuyi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 12:36">fyi n əho apitabwada snuta.” ’<verse eid="MRK 12:36" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 12:37" />Dawuda n əwohni tukwoi ɓə yi wo, ‘Dagayi.’ Kwo ɓa zè n wunanu nsayi waa zhni əwo nugwnu a?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 12:37">Deeji yaakwo kwa kna wo tnubwa n agbmadai.<verse eid="MRK 12:37" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɓəkwnukwnù ntu n owa anyawuyi ɓo.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 12:38" />Shi Yeisu ɓə gnyi woi wunya, wa gna, “Fye la əwyewna n owa anyawuyi. Ɓa ye ɓa zna laɓa n aje ayaakwoi kpe jesnu a ɓyi ɓa əgna zhi n adubayaakwo n mwamwagai, <verse eid="MRK 12:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 12:39" />jesnu a ga ɓa asasekpeba adnagbmai fyi n Ayahudiyibwokwnu n aba mwamwa nyai n awyefnaba. <verse eid="MRK 12:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 12:40" />Ɓa losa anyigbayi apwuwa ɓa pmyi ɓa wu əɓahni n aduwazhni akpamwai. A ɓə ga aza ye pya tata ń əwyei bmyibmyii.”<verse eid="MRK 12:40" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nyigbayi nyaga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 12:41" />Yeisu wa lo wa sasetu n awyei ce gaaga, n aba n a ɓə gnyi ai fyi nyaga nyi jesnu wa shi bəgyé awye shi ɓa ya əɓa gyiwye fyi n Dagayipwuwa nyaɓwasofyiba. Anyaɓwayi bəgyé ɓa ya gyiwye ayaakwo fyi n ɓo. <verse eid="MRK 12:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 12:42" />Ama nyigbayi wyekwoyi, wa ɓe wa ya sisinkəɓwo azhnanai fyi ngwnu-aba, gyiwye to ɓə mwa m.<verse eid="MRK 12:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 12:43" />Yeisu wa yì əwo amwutuyi zhi wa gna, “Gaiciya əmi nu gna fye, nyigbayi wyekwoyi ye wo kwu nyaga yafyi n nyaɓwasofyiba n du azaje nya vnyanya. <verse eid="MRK 12:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 12:44" />Əɓa vnyanya ɓa knyiknyi nu ń əɓa nyaɓwa ɓanyi ga; ama əwo, dna n əwo awyekwo, wo kwu əwo nyahonyahoi ya fyi; ənya vnyanya ń wo ncei lo wa gyianyì ncei.”<verse eid="MRK 12:44" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="MRK 13" />
  <para style="s1">Dagayipwuwa vyiya n aznù əsa kpmaknai nyai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 13:1" />Shi Yeisu ɓə gnyi woi gbmiya n Dagayipwuwa, zaknayi n əwo amwutuyi wa gna wo, “Nyawuyi, Shiawye ha gye! Nyakwnu mimii manai n akwuta yaakwoi n safyi-safyi!”<verse eid="MRK 13:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 13:2" />Yeisu wa dnaɓəgbe, “Fye gye anyakwnu yaakwo ye? Kwuta gbmanyi ho to lo ń kwo ɓə ce tu ń ədo she m; a ɓə la dəhodəhoi shniya shi n əknyi.”<verse eid="MRK 13:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 13:3" />Shi Yeisu ɓə sasetu n Zaitu Əpe n kwo shi n awyei ce gaaga n Dagayipwuwa nyi, Byitusu, Jemyis, Yohana n Andurui ɓa nya wo əɓo fyaa, <verse eid="MRK 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 13:4" />“Gna yi, əɓo ye ɓə zhni n knyi əsai nu a? Jesnu knyiyi nu ɓə zhni əznù nge aɓo ye vnyanya ɓa kwu ga ɓa nu a?”<verse eid="MRK 13:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 13:5" />Yeisu wa gna ɓa: “Fye la əwye ka nabai to əzaho wa dna fye kwoce m. <verse eid="MRK 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 13:6" />Bəgyé ɓə ɓe fyi n əmi əye ɓai gna, ‘Əmi nu zhni əwo,’ jesnu ɓai fyi aza bəgyé kwoce. <verse eid="MRK 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 13:7" />She fye ɓə wo akwnusnu aɓo ɓədo n akwnusnu anabagyii, fye to ɓə vnyi m. Ɓəshishi nu aɓo ye pya ɓai zhni, ama əsa kpmaknayi ye ɓeɓelo nabye. <verse eid="MRK 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 13:8" />Əbyé ɓə laka da əbyé, jesnu əbemi ɓə laka da əbemi. Əknyi ɓə jeashna kwoi sofyi n aba gbowogbowo, jesnu myikwnu kəsnui ɓə gwnu. Aɓo ye nu zhni əɓyima nyasna yaya.<verse eid="MRK 13:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 13:9" />“Ɓəshishi nu fya kwu zhigwu. A ɓə kwu fye ga fyi ń azhi atukwoda akwnu, jesnu a ɓə la fye ɓyeya fyi n Ayahudiyibwokwnu. Ntu əmi ɓo, a ɓə kwu fye lo ncei n agwomna abye ɓədo n asui n zhni aɓəkwnuyi ga əɓa. <verse eid="MRK 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 13:10" />Kwo zhni ɓəshishi nu ai kwu nabagyi manai waazi kpmizhni ga abye vnyanya kpa. <verse eid="MRK 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 13:11" />Əsahosahoi n a wna fye jesnu aa ɓe n fyei n owada bwokwnu, fye to ɓə wodna ntu əɓo ɓo n fye ɓə da m. Fye ɓə ɓwa əɓo nu da n a ga fye kwo nsayii, ntuge əfye nu to ɓə daɓo m, ama Zafnu Gyigyiyi nu.<verse eid="MRK 13:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 13:12" />“Əza ɓə ɓwu əwodo nya lo əfyi, jesnu əda ɓə ɓwu əwo nugwnu. Aɓyi ɓə zhni tukwognanakwo kpe əɓa azamayi ɓai zhni ai kwu ɓa wu. <verse eid="MRK 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 13:13" />Aza vnyanya ɓə wnunu n fyei ntu əmi ɓo, ama əza ń wo ɓə la myignyi nya lo azoba, wo ɓə la pwo.<verse eid="MRK 13:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 13:14" />“She fye ɓə gye ‘əɓokasa n kwo ɓe n abalayai nyi’, ń gnyiagnyi dna ń aba n ɓa to gwo ɓa gnyi m, fa nyabayi wa ɓwa awyega; nlonu aza yi n ɓa fyi n Yahuda əknyi ɓa ɓə bwusi lo ape. <verse eid="MRK 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 13:15" />Əza n wo ɓə tu n əwo nyakwnusni tukwo, wo to ɓə kashi m, kwo woi lo əwo pwuwa wo la nyaho m. <verse eid="MRK 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 13:16" />Əza n wo ɓə dna n bmana wo to ɓə jezelo apyi nabai wo kwu əwo aje m. <verse eid="MRK 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 13:17" />Anyipyei yi ɓə zhni ədna nya nu ń anubwoda aba n aɓyiya dai! <verse eid="MRK 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 13:18" />Fye zhniaduwa nge əfye əsibwi to kwoi ɓe dna n vnyinyikwo nu m, <verse eid="MRK 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 13:19" />ntuge anyipyei gnyagwnugnya nya nu ɓə gnyi, n a too shni ɓa pya wyegye m tunyi n kpmisnui, əsa n Shekwoyi ɓə zhni anyì nyi, nya nsaiye; jesnu a to ɓə je əɓa pya wyegye m kpeekpe.<verse eid="MRK 13:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 13:20" />“Ngye Dagayi nu to ɓə gna wa ce anyipyei yi ceya m, zaho to ɓə ɓa pwo m. Ama ntu n aknyiknyiyi ɓo, aza n wo la knyi nyi, wo la anyipyei yi ce ceya. <verse eid="MRK 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 13:21" />Dna əsayii ń əzaho wa gna fye, ‘Shiawye, Kirisiti gnyi nyi ń ya!’ kwo ‘Shiawye, wo gnyi nu!’ fye to ga kwo gaiciya m. <verse eid="MRK 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 13:22" />Ntuge amasifu akatá nya ɓədo n sheaɓəgwognayi katáii ɓa ɓə kwukazhi ɓai wu aznù, ɓai zhni aɓoawowoi nabai ɓai dna aza kwoce, n kwa ye zhni, du n aknyiknyiyii. <verse eid="MRK 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 13:23" />Ntulonu fye kwu zhigwu; mi kwu ɓəhoɓəhoi gna fye to əsai si m.<verse eid="MRK 13:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 13:24" />“Ama fyi n gnyagwnugnya anyipyei yi avnu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 13:24">“ ‘Nyipyei ɓə la dna wyegbma jesnu əpya to ɓə je əkwo bwuznagna ga m;<verse eid="MRK 13:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 13:25" />akpasi ɓə kaya ń anyìbmana, jesnu anya n ɓa kpe n ashebmana ɓa ɓə jeashna.’<verse eid="MRK 13:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 13:26" />“N əsayii aza ɓə gye Əza Nugwnu woi shnizhi ɓe dna n ənyì n kəsnu kalá yaakwoi n latui. <verse eid="MRK 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 13:27" />Jesnu wo ɓə tnu əwo amaləkai ɓai ye əwo aknyiknyiyi zhi n anyì awyepmyi asəpa ngwnu-anyi, ənya n kwo laka n anyiceshiba, kwoi lo əsheceshiba.<verse eid="MRK 13:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 13:28" />“Nsaiye, fye tu ɓəye mwi n gbaayi shnuwna: əsa n fya gye kwoi kpmi akwo, jesnu kwoi ci afnyitolo, fya kwu kpe nge gbmama n la wo vyivyiwyi. <verse eid="MRK 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 13:29" />Ntulonu, she fye ɓə gye aɓo ye ɓai zhni, fya kpe nge əsa n la wo vyivyiwyi nu, n gnyi ń abwokwnumi əgbe. <verse eid="MRK 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 13:30" />Ɓəhnihni əmi nu gna fye, cala ye taa duya m, akpəge aɓo ye vnyanya ɓa kwu zhni. <verse eid="MRK 13:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 13:31" />Əshe ń əknyii ɓa ɓə la duya, ama əmi aɓədagbma taa duya m nanyinanyi.<verse eid="MRK 13:31" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Əwyi yi n əsai a ta kpeye lo m</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 13:32" />“Ama ntu ń nyipyei yi ɓo, kwo əsa, əzaho ta kpe əkwo əye lo m, kwo amaləka ń ɓa fyi n əshemi nyi, kwo Nugwnu m, akpəge Dada nu ɓwasnu gbmanyi. <verse eid="MRK 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 13:33" />Fye kwu zhigwu! Fye kwu awye ka! Fye ta kpe əsa əye lo n snukna yi ɓe si m. <verse eid="MRK 13:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 13:34" />Kwo wu ngye əza nu n wo lo aba: wa əwo pwuwa fa dna n əwo atnutnuyi akwnu, waa zahozahoyi tnutnu gyi wo əgbe, jesnu wa gna əza n wo gnyi ń abwokwnumi nyi nge, wo la əwyewna.<verse eid="MRK 13:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 13:35" />“Ntucenu, fye kwu zhigwu, ntuge fye ta kpe əsa lo n pwuwada ɓə jezeɓe ncei m; kwo n wyeshei nu, kwo n sukwo sadui nu, kwo əsa nu n pisenugba cekwu ncei nyi kwo n labmi-labmii. <verse eid="MRK 13:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 13:36" />Ndəi n wa ɓe n əsagbmanyii, to ɓə ye woi snu ho shi hoi wnagye m. <verse eid="MRK 13:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 13:37" />Əɓo n mi gna fye nyi, mi gna zahozahoyi nu cè: ‘Fye kwu zhigwu!’ ”<verse eid="MRK 13:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="MRK 14" />
  <para style="s1">Yeisu pmyapmya n Byetani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 14:1" />Nsayii nyagyi gyi Gnanaznu nya ɓədo n Awyefna Biledi Tnayisti nyai, ɓə ɓwace anyipyei ngwnu-aba nu jesnu apirisiti tukwoda n owa anyawuyii ɓə zhi ɓai zna zokwo shni ɓa wna Yeisu fyaa nabai ɓa wu wo <verse eid="MRK 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 14:2" />Ɓa gna, “Ama toge dna n awyefna əsa m, ntolonu m, aza ɓa la əgwulapwi kala.”<verse eid="MRK 14:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 14:3" />Woi ye dna n Byetani, n Sima Nayiwnuyi pwuwa n sasetu n tebwul woi snú, nyikwoza ho wa ɓe n lúulúu əmi snidaii shi n a ɓə zhni kwo n nardi tnadodnai. Wa ɓá lúulúu yi ya jesnu wa zè əmii ya kpe n Yeisu tukwo.<verse eid="MRK 14:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 14:4" />Azaho n ɓa ɓə fyi n ɓo, ɓa gyi minagyii ɓa gna aje, “A zhni əmisnidaí ye agbma n knyiɓei nu a? <verse eid="MRK 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 14:5" />A ɓə ɓa kwnu kwo n du əye ɓwugyi tnutnu gyiwye ya, jesnu a ce gyiwye a ga asnayi.” Ɓa gnaknyi nyikwoza yi n kalái dnadnai.<verse eid="MRK 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 14:6" />Yeisu wa gna ɓa, “Fye la wo fa, knyiyi nu zhni fyei gna wo gnagna a? Wo kwu əɓo manai zhni ga mi. <verse eid="MRK 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 14:7" />Awyekwoyi n kwnusnu lo n fyei ciici, jesnu fye ɓa myi fya bma ɓa zhni əsa n fye ncei pma. Ama fye taa ɓwa əmii da nsahosahoi m. <verse eid="MRK 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 14:8" />Wo kwu əɓo zhni n wo ɓa myi wa zhni. Wa zè nyasnidai ya kpe n əmi nayi n pitalai ntu əmi byibyi ɓo nu. <verse eid="MRK 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 14:9" />Ɓəhnihni mi gna fye, abahobahoi n a ɓə zhni waazi nabagyi manai ye nya vnyanya n anyì, əɓo n wo kwu zhni nyi, a ɓə da kwo ɓo ai pa əwo ɓo.”<verse eid="MRK 14:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 14:10" />Nlonu Yahuda Iskariyoti, zaknayi n awoceaba yi, wa lo da apirisiti atukwoda wo kwnu Yeisu n əɓa aba. <verse eid="MRK 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 14:11" />A da ɓa n mwa shi ɓa ɓə wo ɓəye, jesnu ɓa shi wo ɓəgbe nge ɓa ɓá ga wo gyiwye. Ntulonu waa gnyi woi dna əsa wye n kwo ɓa bmya wa ta wo ya ga ɓa.<verse eid="MRK 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Wyeshenyagyi kpmaknai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 14:12" />N nyipyei kpmisnui Awyefna Biledi Tnayisti nya, she kwo ɓə zhni kwnunu ɓo nu, a ga nyaga Gnanaznu kwugyasnáyi nakpei nya, Yeisu amwutuyi ɓa nya wo əɓo, “Ho ncei pma ya lo yii zhni Gnanaznu nyagyi gyi aba ga ho ń nanu a?”<verse eid="MRK 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 14:13" />Ntulonu wa tnu əwo amwutuyii ngwnu-aba, wa gna ɓa, “Fye lo əzhiyaakwo, fye ɓəə gye əza n nuwna nyikwnui tu wo ɓə shegwnu fye. Fye vyi wo. <verse eid="MRK 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 14:14" />Pwuwa n wo ɓəə lodna n kwo nyi, fye gna pwuwada yi, ‘Nyawuyi nyaɓo lo: Əmi zhiɓeyi nyakwnu gnyi ń nanu, aba n mi ɓa gyi Gnanaznu nyagyi n kwnusnu ń əmi amwutuyii nyi a?’ <verse eid="MRK 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 14:15" />Wo ɓəə wu fye nyakwnusniyi dnagbmai ntu n əshe, n ashnikpegyei pma abazhni zhi. Fye zhniaba aba ga yi n ɓo.”<verse eid="MRK 14:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 14:16" />Amwutuyi ɓa kwnuya lo, ɓa lofyi n əzhiyaakwo yi ɓa gye aɓo n ɓwasnu shi Yeisu ɓə gna ɓa nyi. Ntulonu ɓa zhni Gnanaznu nyagyi ɓo.<verse eid="MRK 14:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 14:17" />She wyeshe ɓə she, Yeisu wa si abaayi n kwnusnu n ngwnu-awoceabai. <verse eid="MRK 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 14:18" />Əsa n ɓa ɓə myima n tebwul ɓai gyi nyagyi, wa gna, “Ɓəhnihni mi gna fye, zaknayi n əfye wo ɓə ɓwu mi; əza n wo kwnu nyagyigyi lo n mii nyi.”<verse eid="MRK 14:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 14:19" />Bwugba kwa wnu ɓa, jesnu əɓa gbmanyigbmanyi ɓa nya wo əɓo, “Ɓəhnihni ho da əmi nu ɓo?”<verse eid="MRK 14:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 14:20" />Wa dnaɓəgbe, “Zaknayi nu n əfye awoceaba ye, n wo kwnu əwo biledi dadna lo n mii n əbwe nyi. <verse eid="MRK 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 14:21" />Əza Nugwnu ɓa lo n ɓwasnu shi a ncei kafyilo ntu əwo ɓo nu. Ama owii n əza yii ń wo nu ɓwu Əza Nugwnu nyi! Kwo ɓəə ɓa wo du ngye to a ye ma wo m.”<verse eid="MRK 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 14:22" />Ɓai ye kpe ɓai gyi nyagyi, Yeisu wa la biledi, she wo ɓə kwu Shekwoyi saami, wa sa kwo ya jesnu wa ga əwo amwutuyi kwo, woi gna, “Fye gwo kwo; dəye nu zhni əmi nayi.”<verse eid="MRK 14:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 14:23" />Nsayi wa la bwoɓyi wa sa Shekwoyi ami wa ga ɓa kwo, jesnu əɓa vnyanya ɓa sni n kwo.<verse eid="MRK 14:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 14:24" />Wa gna ɓa, “Əmi ami nu nyi ɓəgbeshi nya, n a la zeya ntu bəgyé ɓo. <verse eid="MRK 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 14:25" />Ɓəhnihni mi gna fye, mi to ɓə ye je anam wnunuyi gyigyii ye sni m, akpəge n əwyi yii ń mi ɓə sni kwo n woiwoyii n Shekwoyi əbemi.”<verse eid="MRK 14:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 14:26" />She ɓa ɓə kwu anyí kwo, ɓa kwnuya ɓa lo Zaitu Əpe.<verse eid="MRK 14:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeisu pma Byitusu əwo aɓəna ɓo da</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 14:27" />Yeisu wa gna ɓa, “Əfye vnyanya fye ɓə la myiya, ntuge kwo kafyilo:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 14:27">“ ‘Mi ɓa znu knyiknayi ənya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 14:27">jesnu aknyi ɓa ɓə gnamyi.’<verse eid="MRK 14:27" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 14:28" />Ama shi mi ɓə la laka, mi ɓə la gyi n əfye abye lo Gəlili.”<verse eid="MRK 14:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 14:29" />Byitusu wa da, “Ngye kwo aza vnyanya ɓə la myiya, mi to ɓə myiya m.”<verse eid="MRK 14:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 14:30" />Yeisu wa dnaɓəgbe, “Ɓəhnihni mi gna ho, n naiye; əə, dna n sukwo ye; pisenugba ɓə snu n kwo cekwu aɓwa ngwnu-aba hoi la əmi yekpé aɓo na aɓwa ngwnu-ata.”<verse eid="MRK 14:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 14:31" />Ama Byitusu waa gyitu n əwyei bmyi, “Kwo ngye mi ɓa kwnu fyí nu n hoi, mi taa na ho aɓo m nanyinanyi.” Jesnu azaje vnyanya ɓa ɓwa da nlonu nu.<verse eid="MRK 14:31" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Gesemani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 14:32" />Ɓa lo abaho ai yi nge Gesemani, Yeisu wa gna əwo amwutuyi ge, “Fye kwu sase zhi n ya, ma zhnignyi mii zhniaduwa.” <verse eid="MRK 14:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 14:33" />Wa kwu Byitusu, Jemyis n Yohanai n kwnusnu n woi, wa ya bwugbawnu n mwa ɓədo n azhnìgyei <verse eid="MRK 14:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 14:34" />Wa gna ɓa, “Əmi wyewyeyi n nunui lo n bwugbawnui kwoi to n əfyii, fye kwu zhi n ya fya gwu.”<verse eid="MRK 14:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 14:35" />Wa cetala lo n abye ɓwai fyewyi, wa ya shi n əknyi wa zhniaduwa; ngye kwo ɓa yezhni əsa ye kwaa du wo ya. <verse eid="MRK 14:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 14:36" />Wa gna, “Abba, Dada, aɓo vnyanya yezhni n hoi. La bwoɓyi ye pmyi mi ya. Dudulonu, toge əɓo n mi ye m, ama əɓo n ho ye.”<verse eid="MRK 14:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 14:37" />Nlonu wa jezeɓe da əwo amwutuyi wa gye ɓa zhi ɓai wnagye. Wa daɓo n Byitusui, “Sima, fye kwu wnagye nu? Fye to myi fya kwu zhigwu n kwnusnu ń mii snukna gbmanyi m? <verse eid="MRK 14:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 14:38" />Fye kwu zhigwu jesnu fya zhniaduwa, nabai n fye taa kaya fyi n mwumwu m. Zafnu ncei ye lo, ama nayi n gbakalá gbàgbài lo.”<verse eid="MRK 14:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 14:39" />Njesnu wa je laka lo wa zhniaduwa woi daɓo gbmanyigbmanyi. <verse eid="MRK 14:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 14:40" />She wo ɓə jezeɓe, wa je ɓa gye n zhi ɓai wnagye, ntuge awye ɓə kwu ɓa woshna. To ɓa kpe əɓo ye n ɓa ɓá gna wo m.<verse eid="MRK 14:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 14:41" />Wa jezeɓe əɓwa taayi, wa gna ɓa, “Fye ye zhi lo fyei wnagye nu jesnu fyei snu? Kwo la kwnu lonu! Əsa n la si. Fye shiawye, a la Əza Nugwnu taya dna n aleifyizhniyi akwnu. <verse eid="MRK 14:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 14:42" />Fye kwukala! Yii lo! Əmi ɓwuyi nu ɓə nu!”<verse eid="MRK 14:42" /></para>
  <para style="s1">A la Yeisu wna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 14:43" />Woi ɓwagnyi woi ye daɓo, Yahuda, zaknayi n Awoceaba, wa kpeya ɓe. Deeji kwa vyi wo n ɓahnii yeyei n abeyaakwoi n abwusii, ń apirisiti atukwodai, owa anyawuyii, ń abyedai ɓə tnu n ɓai nyi.<verse eid="MRK 14:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 14:44" />Nsayii əzaɓwuyi ɓəə la əznù wu ɓa: “Əza n fya gye ma shewna wo, əwo nu; fye wna wo, fye ɓə la wo lo ncei dna ń abagwuyi atasni.” <verse eid="MRK 14:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 14:45" />Yahuda wa lo da Yeisu n əsagbmanyii wa gna, “Rabyi!” jesnu wa shewna wo. <verse eid="MRK 14:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 14:46" />Aza ɓa taɓwashi Yeisu, ɓa wna wo. <verse eid="MRK 14:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 14:47" />Nlonu zaknayi n aza yi n ɓa ɓə zhi vyivyiwyi nyi, wà wa əwo əbeyaakwo wa znu pirisiti dnagbmai fyenu, kwaa əwo tnubwa kaya.<verse eid="MRK 14:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 14:48" />Yeisu wa gna, “Mi zhni kalákpei tukwoda nu, n fye gnyi fyei ɓe da mi n abeyaakwoi n abwusii fya wna mi i? <verse eid="MRK 14:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 14:49" />Nyipyei dəhodəhoi mi ɓə kwnusnu n fyei, mii wunya dna n Dagayipwuwa ashilagyí, ama to fya wna mi m. Ama ɓəshishinu Shekwoyi anyakagyigyiyi kwa nu.” <verse eid="MRK 14:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 14:50" />Nlonu əwo amwutuyi vnyanya ɓa fa wo ɓa bwusi.<verse eid="MRK 14:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="MRK 14:51" />Əɓyikasa n wo to ɓə n əje yaakwoi kpe m, akpəge jekpe luweluwei, wo ɓə ɓe woi vyi Yeisu. Shi ɓa ɓə wna wo, <verse eid="MRK 14:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MRK 14:52" />wa bwusi n ɓwotoloyii, wa kwu əwo əje luweluwei ya n avnu.<verse eid="MRK 14:52" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeisu gnyi n Sahindiri abye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="MRK 14:53" />Ɓa la Yeisu lo ncei n pirisiti dnagbmai aba, n apirisiti atukwodai vnyanya, abyeda n owa anyawuyii ɓa gwnudo zhi n aba gbmanyi. <verse eid="MRK 14:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MRK 14:54" />Byitusu wa lo woi vyi wo ń tagnyi, n kpaai, waa si pirisiti dnagbmai bwokwnu ashilagyí. N abaayi waa kwnu sase shi n abagwuyii woi wyena.<verse eid="MRK 14:54" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="MRK 14:55" />Apirisiti tukwoda n Sahindiri abwokwnudai vnyanya ɓai zna ɓəgyi katá znashni tu ń Yeisu nabai ɓa wu wo, ama to ɓa ɓwa dəho m. <verse eid="MRK 14:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MRK 14:56" />Bəgyé ɓa ɓe ɓa kwnu aɓo akatá nya tu n əwo tukwo, ama əɓa ɓəda to kwa lodo m.<verse eid="MRK 14:56" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="MRK 14:57" />Nlonu azaho ɓa kwukazhi ɓa gbmi əɓo katá nya ye tu n əwo tukwo: <verse eid="MRK 14:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="MRK 14:58" />“Yi ɓə kwu wo woi gna, ‘Mi ɓə la Dagayipwuwa zanyikwoci nya ye laya jesnu dna n anyipyei ngwnu-ata mi ɓə mi ədo, ń a to mi kwo n aɓwai nu m.’ ” <verse eid="MRK 14:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="MRK 14:59" />Dudulonu kwo əɓa ɓəgbmi to ɓə lodo m.<verse eid="MRK 14:59" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="MRK 14:60" />Nlonu pirisiti dnagbmai wa laka gnyi n əɓa awye wa nya Yeisu əɓo, “Ho taa dnaɓəgbe m? Knyi ɓəgbmi nu nyi n aza ye gbmi ń tu əho tukwo nyi a?” <verse eid="MRK 14:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="MRK 14:61" />Ama Yeisu wa gnyi pyi to wa dnaɓəgbe m.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 14:61">Jesnu pirisiti dnagbmai wa nya wo əɓo, “Əho nu zhni Kirisiti, Anabəlikada Nugwnu?”<verse eid="MRK 14:61" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="MRK 14:62" />Yeisu wa gna, “Əmi nu, fye ɓə gye Əza Nugwnu ń sasetu ń Dagayi ikwo Duduyi ɓwaizhe jesnu woi ɓe n tu ń ənyì əshebmana nya.”<verse eid="MRK 14:62" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="MRK 14:63" />Pirisiti dnagbmai wa sa əwo əje ya, wa nyaɓo, “Yi ye zhi yii zna aɓəkwnuyi aje aknyidei nu shni a? <verse eid="MRK 14:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="MRK 14:64" />Fye kwu wo woi da atukwopmi ɓəda. Fye zhninubwo nge nanu a?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 14:64">Əɓa vnyanya ɓa znu wo əknyi nge wo kwnuce lo n əfyii. <verse eid="MRK 14:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="MRK 14:65" />Nlonu azaho ɓa ya ɓai knyiaknyi kpe wo; ɓa kwu aje wna wo n əwo awyeba, ɓa fyi wo akwnu, ɓa gna, “Da sheɓəgwogna, nyika nu lu ho a?” Jesnu azagwuyi ɓa la wo ɓa lu wo.<verse eid="MRK 14:65" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Byitusu ná Yeisu aɓo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="MRK 14:66" />Shi Byitusu ɓə dna n ashilagyí snuta, zaknayi n pirisiti dnagbmai aɓyinyikwoi atnutnuzhniyi wa ɓaya ɓe. <verse eid="MRK 14:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="MRK 14:67" />Shi wo ɓə gye Byitusu woi wyena, wa shi wo awye byiwuu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 14:67">Wa gna, “Əho ce ho ɓə kwnusnu ń Yeisu Nazeretiyi yii.”<verse eid="MRK 14:67" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="68" style="v" sid="MRK 14:68" />Ama waa kwo aɓo na. Wa gna, “Mi ta kpe əɓo ye lo n ho da, kwo nge ma ɓwa əkwo awyega m,” wa gbmiya lo aduba. Əsa fyewyi pisenugba kwa chekwu.<verse eid="MRK 14:68" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="69" style="v" sid="MRK 14:69" />She ɓyinyikwoyi tnutnuyi ɓə gye wo gnyi n ɓo, wa je aza yi gna n ɓa ɓə gnyagnyi zhi n ɓo nyi, “Əza ye dnalo n ɓa.” <verse eid="MRK 14:69" /><verse number="70" style="v" sid="MRK 14:70" />Jesnu wa na kwo aɓo.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 14:70">Əsa fyewyi, aza n ɓa ɓə gnyiagnyi zhi vyivyiwyi n ɓo nyi, ɓa gna Byitusu, “Ɓəhnihni ho zhni gbmanyi dna n əɓa nu, ntuge ho zhni Gəliliyi nu.”<verse eid="MRK 14:70" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="71" style="v" sid="MRK 14:71" />Wa ya aknyi kpe, woi si nyasi ga ɓa, “Mi ta kpe əza ye əye lo m n fye zhi fyei da əwo əɓo nyi m.”<verse eid="MRK 14:71" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="72" style="v" sid="MRK 14:72" />N əsayisayii pisenugba kwa cekwu əɓwa baayi. Nsayi Byitusu wa pa ɓəda n Yeisu ɓə kwu da wo nyi: “Pisenugba ɓə snu n kwo cekwu aɓwa aba, hoi la əmi yekpé aɓo na aɓwa ngwnu-ata.” Bwugba kwa pmyi wo, wa ya ɓwuci.<verse eid="MRK 14:72" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="MRK 15" />
  <para style="s1">Yeisu gnyi n Byilatusu abye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 15:1" />N labmilabmii, apirisiti atukwoda n abyedai n owa anyawuyii ɓədo n atukwodai vnyanya, ɓa kwu aɓo kwuaje. Ntulonu ɓa pa Yeisu, ɓa gbmiya lo n woi jesnu ɓa wo taya ga Byilatusu.<verse eid="MRK 15:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 15:2" />Byilatusu wa nya wo, “Əho nu zhni Ayahudiyi əsu?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 15:2">Yeisu wa dnaɓəgbe, “Ho kwu da lonu.”<verse eid="MRK 15:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 15:3" />Apirisiti tukwoda ɓa kpe wo aɓo n mwa bəgyé. <verse eid="MRK 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 15:4" />Ntulonu Byilatusu wa je wo əɓo nya, “Ho ta dnaɓəgbe lo nu m? Gye aɓo bəgyé n ɓa zhi ɓai da kpe n əho tukwo nyi.”<verse eid="MRK 15:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 15:5" />Ama Yeisu to wa dudu wa dnaɓəgbe m, əɓo yi kwa wo Byilatusu.<verse eid="MRK 15:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 15:6" />N əsayii, kwo ɓə zhni kwnunu ɓo nu, n awyefna sa azhni a lo zhalu da ya əza n ɓa knyi. <verse eid="MRK 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 15:7" />Əza ai yi wo Barabas ɓə dna n zhalu n kwnusnu n aza afasayii n ɓa ɓə wu əza ń gbuzui əsa. <verse eid="MRK 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 15:8" />Deeji kwa ɓe kwa nya Byilatusu nge, wo zhni əɓo ga ɓa n wo shni amida woi zhni nyi.<verse eid="MRK 15:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 15:9" />Byilatusu wa nyaɓo, “Fye ncei pma ma lo ya ga fye Ayahudiyi əsu nu?” <verse eid="MRK 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 15:10" />Woi kpe nge shewo nu ɓə zhni apirisiti tukwoda ɓaa Yeisu taya ga wo. <verse eid="MRK 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 15:11" />Ama apirisiti atukwoda ɓa fyi deeji bwugba aɓwaya, nge ɓa ɓəwyi, nabai Byilatusu wa lo Barabas ya ga ɓa toge Yeisu m.<verse eid="MRK 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 15:12" />Byilatusu wa nyaɓo, “Knyiyi nu n mi ɓa zhni, nsayi, n əza yei n fye yi nge Ayahudiyi əsu nyi a?”<verse eid="MRK 15:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 15:13" />Ɓa ɓəwyi, “A la wo znudu!”<verse eid="MRK 15:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 15:14" />Byilatusu wa nyaɓo, “Ntu n knyiɓei a? Knyi ɓəgalai nu n wo kwu zhni a?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 15:14">Ama ɓa ɓəwyi əɓa vnyanya n əgbei latu, ɓa gna, “A la wo znudu!”<verse eid="MRK 15:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 15:15" />Wo ɓə ncei pma wa zhni əɓo n kwo dá deeji, Byilatusu waa Barabas loya ga ɓa. Wa zhni aa Yeisu ɓyeya, jesnu wa ta wo ya ga ɓa, aa wo znudu.<verse eid="MRK 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Akwnuyi kpe Yeisu agyè</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 15:16" />Akwnuyi ɓa la Yeisu lo ncei dna n galukwo (əkwo nu gyi nge, owada bwokwnu) jesnu ɓa yi akwnuyi okwu zhi vnyanya. <verse eid="MRK 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 15:17" />Ɓa kwu aje bmyinabmyina kpe wo, nlonu ɓa pmyi aknawui fnunyi nya ɓaa kwo kwnu wo. <verse eid="MRK 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 15:18" />Jesnu ɓa ya ɓai yi wo, “Haamwasa, Ayahudiyi əsu!” <verse eid="MRK 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 15:19" />Ɓa lu wo ń tukwo n bwusii ɓai bmakpe-bmakpe jesnu ɓa knyiaknyi kpe wo. Ɓa knyiakwokwo zhi ɓai ɓyi wo gna agyèkpe nya. <verse eid="MRK 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 15:20" />Njesnu she ɓa ɓə kwu pwo wo agyèkpe ɓo, ɓa kpma wo əje-kpadalai ya, ɓa kpe wo əwohni aje. Nlonu ɓa lo n woi ə la wo znudu.<verse eid="MRK 15:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeisu znuznudu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 15:21" />Əzaho woi gbmi n Sireni, ai yi wo Sima, Alekzanda dada ɓədo n Rufusii, wo ɓə duya n səpai woi wna zokwo nu woi zhi aba, jesnu ɓa tu wo znudu n akalái. <verse eid="MRK 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 15:22" />Ɓa ɓe n Yeisui n aba n a yi kwo nge Gwolgwota (n əkwo nu gyi “aba n atukwobwe zhi”). <verse eid="MRK 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 15:23" />Nsayi ɓa ga wo anamnuwna n gbmiaje n myirii, ama to wa ye kwo sni ɓo m. <verse eid="MRK 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 15:24" />Nlonu ɓaa wo znudu. Ɓa gna əwo aje, ɓa she əba ɓa gye ədo n zahozahoyi ɓa ɓwa.<verse eid="MRK 15:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 15:25" />Snukna ciwagbmanyi nu n labmii n ɓa ɓə znu wo du. <verse eid="MRK 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 15:26" />Ɓa ka ənya kpe n əwo znudu əshe, əɓo n ɓa ɓə ncei tu nge wo ɓə zhni nyi, əkwo nu ɓə nyi:</para>
  <para style="pc" vid="MRK 15:26">Ayahudiyi Əsu.<verse eid="MRK 15:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 15:27" />Ɓa kwu akalákpeyi ngwnu-aba znudu kpe n kwnusnu n woi, gbmanyi n ma n əwo ɓwaizhe jesnu gbmanyi n ma n əwo ɓwaipmi. [<verse eid="MRK 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 15:28" />Ntulonu Nyakagyigyiyi kwo kwu nu n kwo gna, “A ɓə n woi ba dna n kwnusnu n aleifyizhniyi.”] <verse eid="MRK 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 15:29" />Aza yi n ɓa ɓə duya n səpai ɓa knyi wo akpmi, ɓai myi atukwo jesnu ɓai gna, “Gye! Əho n ho ɓa la Dagayipwuwa ya jesnu ha mi kwo dna n anyipyei ngwnu-ata nyi, <verse eid="MRK 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 15:30" />kashi ɓe n znudu ha gnyi əhohni!” <verse eid="MRK 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 15:31" />N ɓwasnu nlonu, apirisiti tukwoda ɓədo n owa anyawuyii ɓa kpe wo agyè, fyi ɓahniɓahni ɓai gna, “Wo ɓə la azaje gnyi, ama wo ta myilo n əwohni gnyi m! <verse eid="MRK 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 15:32" />Akpəge Kirisiti ye, Aisrailayi əsu wo kashi shnizhi n znudu nsaiye, nabai n yi ɓa gyewye jesnu ya ga gaiciya.” Aza yi n a ɓə znu ɓa du n woi nyi, ɓa knyi wo akpmi cè.<verse eid="MRK 15:32" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeisu fyífyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 15:33" />N nyipyei atukwogwnui, wyegbma kwa ɓe kpe n əknyii vnyanya nya snukna ngwnu-ata nyipyei nya. <verse eid="MRK 15:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 15:34" />Nlonu dna n snukna ngwnu-ata n nyipyei, Yeisu wa yì n bəgyei latu, “Eloi, Eloi, lama sabachthani?” (N əkwo nu gyi nge, “Əmi Shekwoyi, əmi Shekwoyi, knyiyi nu zhni honyi la mi ya a?”)<verse eid="MRK 15:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 15:35" />She aza n ɓa ɓə wo vyivyiwyi zhi n ɓo, ɓə wo dəye, ɓa gna, “Fye knatnubwa, wo yi Iliya lo.”<verse eid="MRK 15:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 15:36" />Əzaho wa bwusi, wa da sooso fyi n anamnuwna mamai, wa pa kwo gyi n bwusi, wa ga Yeisu nge wo sni. Wa gna, “Nsaiye fye fa wo. Yi kwu zhi ya gye ngye Iliya ɓa ɓe wa ka wo shi əknyi.”<verse eid="MRK 15:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 15:37" />Ǹ əwyiɓe yaakwoi, Yeisu wa kpma əsnu ya.<verse eid="MRK 15:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 15:38" />Əjesa n a ɓə ncei kna n Dagayipwuwa nyi, kwa gnajeya ngwnu-aba, ənya n kwo laka n əshe kwoi lo snuta.<verse eid="MRK 15:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 15:39" />She bəzhetagyida, n wo ɓə gnyi n Yeisu abye nyi, wa kwu gye she Yeisu ɓə fyi, wa gna, “Ɓəhnihni, əza ye ɓə zhni Shekwoyi Nugwnu nu!”<verse eid="MRK 15:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 15:40" />Anyikwoza ho ɓə zhi ɓai shiawye n tagnyi. N əɓa atasni Mariyamwu Magadalayi, Mariyamwu Jemyis nawyi əya n Yusufu nyai, ɓədo n Salomyii. <verse eid="MRK 15:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 15:41" />Dna n Gəlili, anyikwoza ye nu ɓə vyi wo ɓai wna wo əɓo akna. Anyikwoza aje n ɓa ɓə kwnu Urishelima ɓe n woi nyi, ɓa ɓə zhi n ɓo ce.<verse eid="MRK 15:41" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeisu byibyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 15:42" />Nyipyei yi ɓə zhni aɓo aknawna nya nu (əkwo nu zhni nyipyei n kwo gyi ń Asibyiwyi abye). Ntucenu she wyeshe ɓə gnyi kwoi she, <verse eid="MRK 15:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 15:43" />Yusufu Arimatiya, əza əwyekpewuyi n wo ɓə dna n abwokwnuda, əza n wo ɓə gnyi woi pmi Shekwoyi əbemi nu cè, wa ɓwa bwugbakala wa lo da Byilatusu wa nya Yeisu nayi ɓo. <verse eid="MRK 15:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 15:44" />Ca wo Byilatusu shi wo ɓə wo nge Yeisu ɓəə la lu fyí. Wa tnu bəzhetagyida ɓo, wa nya wo ngye Yeisu la lu fyífyi nu. <verse eid="MRK 15:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 15:45" />Shi wo ɓə wo n bəzhetagyida nge kwo lo nlonu nu, waa nayi ga Yusufu. <verse eid="MRK 15:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 15:46" />Ntulonu Yusufu wa ɓe n aje luweluwei wa shni Yeisu nayi shi əknyi, waa kwo kpmidna n aje luweluwei, jesnu waa kwo ya dna n vnyigwo n a ɓə ncei nyi dna n kwuta nyi. Nlonu wa pmyi kwuta ma n vnyigwo əgbe. <verse eid="MRK 15:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 15:47" />Mariyamwu Magadalayi n Mariyamwu Yusufu əyai ɓa kwu gye aba n a ɓə n woi yadna.<verse eid="MRK 15:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="MRK 16" />
  <para style="s1">Yeisu Əfyikalala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 16:1" />She Sibyiwyi ɓə la duya, Mariyamwu Magadalayi, Mariyamwu Jemyis əya, ɓədo n Salomyii, ɓa si anyasnidaí nabai n ɓa ɓə lo ɓai pmya Yeisu nayi. <verse eid="MRK 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 16:2" />N labmilabmii, n nyipyei kpmisnui laadi yi nya, nyipyei ye ɓwa kpekpetu, ɓa wna əzna lo vnyigwo yi <verse eid="MRK 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 16:3" />nlonu ɓa nya aje əɓo, “Nyika nu ɓə pmyi kwuta ya n kwo gwu n vnyigwo əgbe nyi a?”<verse eid="MRK 16:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 16:4" />Ama she ɓa ɓə kpmiawye wu, ɓa gye nge kwuta yaakwo yi, a la kwo pmyiya. <verse eid="MRK 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 16:5" />Shi ɓa ɓə lofyi n vnyigwo, ɓa gye əɓyikasa n aje abwuibwui kpe n sasetu n ɓwaizhe ɓwa, ədna kwa wo ɓa.<verse eid="MRK 16:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 16:6" />Wa gna, “Ədna to wo fye m, fye zna Yeisu Nazeretiyi nu shni n a ɓə znu wo du nyi. Wo la laka! Wo to dnalo n ya m. Fye gye aba n ɓa ɓə n woi yashi nyi. <verse eid="MRK 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 16:7" />Ntucenu fye lo fye gna əwo amwutuyi ɓədo n Byitusui, ‘Wo gyilo ń əfye abye woi lo Gəlili. N abaayi nu ń fye ɓəə gye wo əwye, n ɓwasnu shi wo ɓə gna fye nyi.’ ”<verse eid="MRK 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 16:8" />N zhi ɓai vnyi jesnu n nunui zhi n ɓəwowoi, anyikwoza ye ɓa kwnuya n Yeisu vnyigwo ɓa bwusi. Ɓa to ɓə da ɓəhoɓəhoi n zahozahoyi m, ntuge ədna ɓə wo ɓa.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 16:8">[<verse eid="MRK 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 16:9" />Əsa n Yeisu ɓə laka n labmii n nyipyei kpmisnui laadi yi nya, wo ɓə kpmi kpeya da Mariyamwu Magadalayi nu, əza n wo ɓə kwnu wo ase ya ngwnu-tnaaba nyi. <verse eid="MRK 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 16:10" />Wa lo wa gna aza yi n ɓa ɓə kwnusnu n Yeisui nyi, n ɓa ɓə zhi ɓai zhni bwugbazhii ɓai ciɓwi. <verse eid="MRK 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 16:11" />She ɓa ɓə wo nge Yeisu wo n wyewyeyi lo jesnu nge Mariyamwu Magadalayi wo kwu wo gyewye, to ɓa ga ce gaiciya m.<verse eid="MRK 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 16:12" />N dəye avnu Yeisu wa kpeya da əɓa ngwnu-aba n shnado shnashnai, əsa n ɓa ɓə lo ɓai znazna ń zhigba. <verse eid="MRK 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 16:13" />Aza ye ɓa jezezhi jesnu ɓa wu anabagyi; ama to ɓa ga ɓa gaiciya ce m.<verse eid="MRK 16:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 16:14" />N dəye avnu Yeisu wa kpeya da ngwnu awocei-gbmanyi əsa n ɓa ɓə fyi ɓai gyi nyagyi. Wa gnaknyi ɓa ntu əɓa tnagaiciyaganunui ɓo jesnu n əɓa bwugba akalákpei, n ɓa to ɓə ga aza yi gaiciya, n ɓa ɓə kwu wo gyewye ń əwo əfyikalala avnu nyi m.<verse eid="MRK 16:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 16:15" />Wa gna ɓa, “Fye lofyi n anyì vnyanya, fyee zhni waazi nabagyi manai nya ga aza vnyanya. <verse eid="MRK 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 16:16" />Zahozahoyi n wa ga gaiciya, aa kwu batizima zhni wo, wo ɓə la pwo, ama zahozahoyi n wo to ga gaiciya m, a ɓə la wo znuknyi. <verse eid="MRK 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 16:17" />Nlonu n aznù ye ɓə vyi aza yi n ɓa kwu gaiciyaga nyi: Dna n əmi əye ɓa ɓə kwnu ase ya; ɓa ɓə daɓo n anyitala woiwoyii; <verse eid="MRK 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 16:18" />ɓa ɓə kwu awa shi n əɓa aɓwai; əsa n ɓa sni əmwi nukwoi, kwo to ɓə wu ɓa əɓwa m nanyinanyi; ɓa ɓə kpe anyasnayi əɓa aɓwa jesnu ɓa ɓə ɓwa kágna.”<verse eid="MRK 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 16:19" />N dəye avnu she Dagayi Yeisu ɓə kwu ɓəda da n ɓai, a la wo gwnulo ncei n əshemi, waa sasetu n Shekwoyi ɓwaizhe ɓwa. <verse eid="MRK 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 16:20" />Nlonu amwutuyi ɓa kwnuya jesnu ɓa zhni waazi n ɓwahoɓwahoi, nlonu Dagayi wa zhni tnutnu n kwnusnu n ɓai jesnu wa wu ikwo əwo ɓədagbma nya n aznùi n ɓa ɓə vyi kwo nyi.]<verse eid="MRK 16:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 16" />
</usx>